<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1CH" style="id" />
  <para style="h">1 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="toc1">1 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="mt1">1 Krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="imt">Rik tekah mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih rui miia dow aming tukah dowi chekhai; nachepaw Ezra naown kown mih sakowmra uowi, now rui mih khin dow 400 BC khe chekhai. 1 hai 2 Krungchakuüa bowih mih auown khe dow pabowih sang chowdiah; tawkche akung kowi dow ta changah pre bowih khai. Mami bowih kowi arui uowi mih dow Samuel bowih hai Manguüa bowih kowi kowh arui uowi mih hown tatu chekhai. Tawkche Krungchakuüa bowih dow lümla pra kowh lawnguan kowi lang pe kür khai, now Samuel hai Manguüa bowih dow amatni kowh chownglawng lawnguan kowi lang pe kür khai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi dow akeng bowih kowi lak-e Uamowuüa, Leviuüa, tünteu tep miuüa, meng sarauüa hai Thurai chup kim khet miuüa lawnguan achima arui uowi chekhai. Now Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih, nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih kamrütra hai Juda pren kowi kowh aiungma mih manguüa tawng iawng chow krawi plan raw pren mih lawnguan paw Krungchakuüa bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mami bowih kowi kowh uang tek kown nau mih dow aia maru-uüa hai Jerusalem kowi kowh mang lawnguan kowi Thurai kowh kamrütra uowi reng pami chekhai.</para>
  <para style="is">Auan tuk takla mih laiklow</para>
  <para style="ili">Takhangra: Takhangra pami dow ransu-uüa hown tasen kowh sum khe ransu-uüa khümla now amatni pren kowi towah mih rah kowi kowh tekah mih chekhai. Naiawng takhangra kowi uowi miuüa dow nar kowi uowi khe kowh iawng maru nimkrüa kowi lup chang takla reng chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Kangchawng mih: Kangchawng mih pami dow kim kowi lah marow kowi lah maru uang ia kuh hai uang ia senla dowi kownkow towah mih achawng mih kowi tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="ili">Hiareng: Hiareng pami dow sakkraingma hai tasen kiakma mih maru kowi kowh tek pe mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="iot">Alak kowi kowh uowi mih lawnguan</para>
  <para style="io1">Adam hownia mang Sawl mowr krungchakuüa ming 1:1-9:44</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang Sawl kowng mih 10:1-14</para>
  <para style="io1">Mang David kowh chownglawng lawnguan 11:1-29:30</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1CH 1" />
  <para style="ms">Adam hownia Abraham mowr mih krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="s">Adam krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 1:1" />Adam chapa dow Set, Set chapa Enaws, <verse eid="1CH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 1:2" />Enaws chapa Kenan, Kenan chapa Mahalalel, Mahalalel chapa Jared, <verse eid="1CH 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 1:3" />Jared chapa Enawk, Enawk chapa Methusela, Methusela chapa Lamek, now Lamek chapa Noa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 1:4" />Noa chapauüa dow Sem, Ham hai Jafet büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jafet krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 1:5" />Jafet kowh chapauüa dow Gomer, Magawg, Madai, Javan, Tubal, Masek hai Tiras büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 1:6" />Gomer kowh chapauüa dow Askenaz, Rifat hai Togarma büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 1:7" />Javan kowh chapauüa dow Elisa, Tarsis, Kittim hai Rodanim büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ham krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 1:8" />Ham kowh chapauüa dow Kus, Mizraim, Put hai Kanan büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 1:9" />Kus kowh chapauüa dow Seba, Havila, Sabta, Rama hai Sabteka büah chekhai. Rama chapauüa dow Seba hai Dedan iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 1:10" />Kus kowh dow Nimrud pape mih paw chapa uowi lowk ia tak. Nimrud dow lusa kowi kowh tasen kiakma uang rik phaw mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 1:11" />Mizraim kowh krungchakuüa dow Luduüa, Anamuüa, Lehabuüa, Naptu-uüa, <verse eid="1CH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 1:12" />Pathrusuüa, Kreteuüa hai Kaslu-uüa chekhai. (Kaslu krungchakuüa dow Filistinuüa chekhai). <verse eid="1CH 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 1:13" />Kanan kowh chapa lang ta mih ming dow Sidawn. Sidawn kung kowi kowh uang dia mih dow Het. Kanan kowh krungchakuüa dow Hetuüa, <verse eid="1CH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 1:14" />Jebusuüa, Amawruüa, Girgasuüa, <verse eid="1CH 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 1:15" />Hivuüa, Arkituüa, Sinuüa, <verse eid="1CH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 1:16" />Arvaduüa, Zemaruüa hai Hamatuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sem krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 1:17" />Sem kowh chapauüa dow Elam, Asur, Arpasad, Lud hai Aram büah chekhai. Aram kowh chapauüa dow Uz, Hul, Gether hai Mesek büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 1:18" />Arpasad kowh chapa dow Sela chekhai, now Sela kowh chapa dow Eber chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 1:19" />Eber kowh dow chapa uowi pre ia. Achapa lowk ia mih ming dow Pelek; nami khin khe lusa tabak khai rakowi nami ming dow nami auan kowi rükah mih chekhai. Pelek kowh naumow ming dow Jawktan. <verse eid="1CH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 1:20" />Jawktan kowh chauüa dow Almadad, Selep, Hazarmavet, Jera, <verse eid="1CH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 1:21" />Hadoram, Uzal, Dikla, <verse eid="1CH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 1:22" />Obal, Abimael, Seba, <verse eid="1CH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 1:23" />Ofir, Havila hai Jawbab büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 1:24" />Mami dow Sem kowh krungchakuüa chekhai. Sem kowh chapa dow Arpasad, Arpasad kowh chapa Sela, <verse eid="1CH 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 1:25" />Sela kowh chapa Eber, Eber kowh chapa Peleg, Peleg kowh chapa Reu, <verse eid="1CH 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 1:26" />Reu kowh chapa Serug, Serug kowh chapa Nahawr, Nahawr kowh chapa Tera, <verse eid="1CH 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 1:27" />now Tera kowh chapa Abram chekhai. (Abram dow Abraham chekhai).<verse eid="1CH 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Abraham krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 1:28" />Abraham kowh chapa dow Isak hai Ismael iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 1:29" />Maiawngün dow amatchi kowh krungchakuüa lawnguan chekhai. Ismael kowh chapa lang ta mih ming dow Nebaiawt, nami kung kowi dow Kedar, Adbel, Mibsam, <verse eid="1CH 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 1:30" />Misma, Duma, Masa, Hadad, Tema, <verse eid="1CH 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 1:31" />Jetur, Nafis hai Kedema büah chekhai. Amatni dow Ismael kowh laipre ia mih chapauüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 1:32" />Aia <char style="w">changla masi mih narma</char> Ketura hown kowh Abraham kaah mih chapauüa dow Zimran, Jawksan, Medan, Midian, Isbak hai Sua büah chekhai. Jawksan kowh chapauüa dow Seba hai Dedan iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 1:33" />Midian kowh chapauüa dow Efa, Efer, Hanawk, Abida hai Elda büah chekhai. Naiawngün bowkbowk dow Ketura kowh chapauüa hai chu-uüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Esau krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 1:34" />Abraham kowh chapa dow Isak chekhai. Isak kowh chapa dow Esau hai Jakawb iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 1:35" />Esau kowh chapauüa dow Elifaz, Reuel, Jeus, Jalam hai Kora büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 1:36" />Elifaz kowh chapauüa dow Teman, Awmar, Zefaw, Gatam, Kenaz hai Amalek büah chekhai. Amalek dow Timna hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 1:37" />Reuel kowh chapauüa dow Nahat, Zera, Sama hai Miza büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawm pren kowi rik uowi mih maru-uüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 1:38" />Seir kowh chapauüa dow Lotan, Sobal, Zibeawn, Ana, Disawn, Ezer hai Disan büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 1:39" />Lotan kowh chapauüa dow Hawr hai Hemam iüah chekhai. Lotan kowh tuamow ming dow Timna. <verse eid="1CH 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 1:40" />Sobal kowh chapauüa dow Alvan, Manahat, Ebal, Sefaw hai Awnam büah chekhai. Zibeawn kowh chapauüa dow Aiah hai Ana iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 1:41" />Ana kowh chapa ming dow Disawn. Disawn kowh chapauüa dow Hemdan, Esban, Ithran hai Keran büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 1:42" />Ezer kowh chapauüa dow Bilhan, Zavan hai Akan büah chekhai. Disan kowh chapauüa dow Uz hai Aran iüah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Edawm pren kowi kowh manguüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 1:43" />Maiawngün dow Israeluüa kowh mang uowi dowi rawn tak khe Edawm pren kowi kowh chowm mang mih manguüa ming chekhai. Beur kowh chapa Bela dow Edawm pren kowi chowm mang khai. Aia kowh marow kri ming dow Dinhaba chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 1:44" />Bela kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Bawzra marow kowi kowh Zera chapa Jawbab chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 1:45" />Jawbab kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Temanuüa pren kowi kowh Husam chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 1:46" />Husam kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Bedad kowh chapa Hadad chekhai. Aia dow Moab pren kowi kowh Midianuüa kowi nowngta khai. Aia kowh marow kri ming dow Avit chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 1:47" />Hadad kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Masreka marow kowi kowh Samla chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 1:48" />Samla kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Rehawbawt marow kowi kowh Sawl chekhai. Sawl dow Iufratis aw pang kowi kowh uowi mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 1:49" />Sawl kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Akbawr kowh chapa Balhanan chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 1:50" />Balhanan kowng kung kowi kowh ta chowm mang mih dow Hadad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hadad </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming Uown Thawp 36:39 kowi dow Hadar pahai arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> chekhai. Aia kowh marow kri ming dow Pau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:50 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pau </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming Uown Thawp 36:39 kowi dow Pai pahai arui uowi chekhai.</char></note>, now aia kowh masi ming dow Mehetabel chekhai. Mehetabel kowh pa ming dow Matred, now Matred kowh pa ming dow Mezahab chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 1:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 1:51" />Akung kowi Hadad dow kowng khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 1:51">Edawm pren kowi kowh krungchak aluchowuüa dow Timna, Alva, Jethet, <verse eid="1CH 1:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 1:52" />Awhawlibama, Ela, Pinawn, <verse eid="1CH 1:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 1:53" />Kenaz, Teman, Mibzar, <verse eid="1CH 1:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 1:54" />Magdiel hai Iram büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 1:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1CH 2" />
  <para style="s">Israel kowh chapauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 2:1" />Israel kowh chapauüa dow Reuben, Simiawn, Levi, Juda, Isakar, Zebulun, <verse eid="1CH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 2:2" />Dan, Josef, Benjamin, Naptali, Gad hai Aser büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Juda krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 2:3" />Juda kowh chapauüa dow Er, Awnan hai Sela büah chekhai. Kowbüah sum ia kowi dow Bat-Sua hown kowh Juda kaah mih chekhai. Bat-Sua dow Kanan chenchap masiuüa chekhai. Juda kowh chapa ta Er dow CHAKRAMANG mik kowi angakma mih lup chang khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi saita khai. <verse eid="1CH 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 2:4" />Now aiaumow Tamar hown kowh Juda kaah mih chapauüa dow Perez hai Zera iüah chekhai. Juda kowh chapa dow bowkbowk kowi tanga ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 2:5" />Perez kowh chapauüa dow Hezrawn hai Hamul iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 2:6" />Zera kowh chapauüa dow Zimri, Ethan, Heman, Kalkawl hai Darda büah chekhai. Amatni dow bowkbowk kowi tanga ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 2:7" />Zimri kowh chu Akan kowh pa dow Karmi chekhai. (Akan kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Akar chekhai. Akar pami auan dow phih iukma pami chekhai). Aia dow hangah mih uanh kowi nü dowi klowk dowi chekhai. Nami hownia aia dow Israeluüa luk kowi uang pawla phih khai. <verse eid="1CH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 2:8" />Ethan kowh chapa dow Azaria chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 2:9" />Hezrawn kowh chapauüa dow Jeramel, Ram hai Kaleb büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ram krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 2:10" />Ram kowh chapa Aminadab, now Aminadab kowh chapa dow Nasawn chekhai. Nasawn dow Juda krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 2:11" />Nasawn kowh chapa Salma, now Salma kowh chapa dow Boaz chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 2:12" />Boaz kowh chapa Obed, now Obed kowh chapa dow Jese chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 2:13" />Jese kowh chapa ta dow Eliab chekhai. Eliab kung kowi dow Abinadab, Simea, <verse eid="1CH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 2:14" />Nethanel, Radai, <verse eid="1CH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 2:15" />Awzem hai David büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 2:16" />Amatni kowh tuamow dow Zerui hai Abigail iüah chekhai. Zerui kowh dow chapa uowi sum ia. Achapauüa ming dow Abisai, Joab hai Asahel büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 2:17" />Abigail kowh hua dow Jether chekhai, now amatchi kowh chapa dow Amasa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezrawn krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 2:18" />Hezrawn kowh chapa Kaleb kowh masi Azuba hai Jeriawt <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jeriawt </char><char style="ft" closed="false">lawnguan kowi dow Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai. Naiawng rakowi tawngbak mih Baibul kowi dow Kaleb kowh masi powm iawng tekah khai, now tawngbak mih dow Kaleb kowh chama iawng tekah khai.</char></note>iüah dow kum nau hanow ka cha iüah khai. Azuba kowh chapauüa dow Jeser, Sawbab hai Ardawn büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 2:19" />Amasi Azuba kowng kung kowi Kaleb mih Efrat kowi ta paw khai. Efrat hown kowh Kaleb kaah mih chapa dow Hur chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 2:20" />Hur kowh chapa Uri, now Uri kowh chapa dow Bezalel chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 2:21" />Hezrawn dow aia 60 ning khe Makir kowh chapa Gilead tuamow hown tachawng khai. Amatchi kowh chapa dow Segub chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 2:22" />Segub kowh chapa dow Jair chekhai. Jair kowh dow Gilead süng kowi marow uowi 23 buk chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 2:23" />Nachenganchepaw Gesur hai Aram iüah dow nakowi kowh Havawt-Jair marow hai Kenat marow mih kowpowngta pe khai. Nami klen kowi naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh 60 kua krawi powngta iüah khai. Naiawngün arah kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow Gilead chapa Makir krungchakuüa kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 2:24" />Kaleb-Efrat marow kowi Hezrawn kowng kung amasi Abija dow ta pen chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Asur chekhai. Asur dow thawp kua lowk hanow Tekoa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tekoa </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Asur kowh chapa ming chekhai.</char></note> pahai chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="1CH 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jeramel krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 2:25" />Hezrawn kowh chapa ta dow Jeramel, now Jeramel kowh chapa ta dow Ram chekhai. Ram kung kowi kowh uang ta dia miuüa dow Buna, Awren, Awzem hai Ahija büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 2:26" />Jeramel kowh dow Atara pami paw masi uowi lowk ia tak chekhai. Awman hown kowh Jeramel kaah mih chapa ming dow Awnam chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 2:27" />Jeramel kowh chapa ta Ram kowh chapauüa dow Maz, Jamin hai Eker büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 2:28" />Awnam kowh chapauüa dow Samai hai Jada iüah chekhai. Samai kowh chapauüa dow Nadab hai Abisur iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 2:29" />Abisur kowh masi ming dow Abihail chekhai. Abihail hown kowh Abisur kaah mih chapauüa dow Aban hai Malid iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 2:30" />Nadab kowh chapauüa dow Seled hai Apaim iüah chekhai. Seled dow kala chah dowi kowi kowng khai. <verse eid="1CH 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 2:31" />Apaim kowh chapa dow Isi, Isi kowh chapa Sesan, now Sesan kowh chapa dow Alai chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 2:32" />Samai kowh tainau Jada kowh chapauüa dow Jether hai Jonathan iüah chekhai. Jether dow kala chah dowi kowi kowng khai. <verse eid="1CH 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 2:33" />Jonathan kowh chapauüa dow Pelet hai Zaza iüah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Jeramel krungchak chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 2:34" />Sesan kowh dow chama kangowh chekhai; lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi chekhai. Aia kowh dow Jarha pami Aigupta hownia kowh nar uowi lowk ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 2:35" />Sesan dow aia kowh nar Jarha hown achama kowi pe tachawngah khai, now nami masiuüa dow kum nau hanow ka chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Atai chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 2:36" />Atai kowh chapa dow Nathan, Nathan kowh chapa dow Zabad, <verse eid="1CH 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 2:37" />Zabad kowh chapa dow Eflal, Eflal kowh chapa dow Obed, <verse eid="1CH 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 2:38" />Obed kowh chapa dow Jehu, Jehu kowh chapa dow Azaria, <verse eid="1CH 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 2:39" />Azaria kowh chapa dow Helez, Helez kowh chapa dow Eleasa, <verse eid="1CH 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 2:40" />Eleasa kowh chapa dow Sismai, Sismai kowh chapa dow Salum, <verse eid="1CH 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 2:41" />Salum kowh chapa dow Jekamia, Jekamia kowh chapa dow Elisama chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kaleb krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 2:42" />Jeramel kowh tainau Kaleb kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang ta mih dow Mesa chekhai. Mesa kowh chapa dow Zif, Zif kowh chapa dow Maresa, now Maresa kowh chapa dow Hebrawn chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 2:43" />Hebrawn kowh chapauüa dow Kora, Tapua, Rekem hai Sema büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 2:44" />Sema kowh chapa dow Raham, now Raham kowh chapa dow Jawrkeam chekhai. Rekem kowh chapa dow Sema, <verse eid="1CH 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 2:45" />Sema kowh chapa dow Maawn, now Maawn kowh chapa dow Bet-Zur chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 2:46" />Changla masi mih narma Efa hown kowh Kaleb kaah mih chapauüa dow Haran, Mawzan hai Gazez büah chekhai. Haran kowh chapa ming paw Gazez pahai rükah khai.<verse eid="1CH 2:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 2:47" />(Jadai pami maru lowk ia kowh chapauüa dow Regem, Jotham, Gesan, Pelet, Efa hai Saf büah chekhai).<verse eid="1CH 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 2:48" />Changla masi mih alowk mih narma Maka hown kowh Kaleb kaah mih chapauüa dow Seber, Tirhana, <verse eid="1CH 2:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 2:49" />Saf hai Seva büah chekhai, now achama uowi lowk ia mih dow Aksa chekhai. Saf dow thawp marow lowk hanow Madmana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:49 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Madmana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami akeng Baibul kowi dow Saf kowh chapa iawng hai tekah khai.</char></note> pahai chap pe ming khai, now Seva paw thawp marow pre buk hanow Makbena hai Gibea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:49 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Makbena hai Gibea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami marow ming dow akeng Baibul kowi Seva kowh chapa ming iawng hai tekah khai. </char></note> pahai chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="1CH 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 2:50" />Maiawngün paw Kaleb kowh chapauüa lawnguan chekhai. Amasi Efratha hown kowh Kaleb kaah mih chapa ta dow Hur chekhai. Hur kowh chapauüa dow Sobal, Salma hai Haref büah chekhai. Sobal dow thawp marow lowk hanow Kiriat-Jearim pahai chap pe ming khai. <verse eid="1CH 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 2:51" />Salma paw thawp marow lowk hanow Bethlehem pahai chap pe ming khai, now Haref paw thawp marow lowk hanow Bet-Gader pahai chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="1CH 2:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 2:52" />Kiriat-Jearim marow thawp miia Sobal krungchakuüa dow Haraw hai Menuhawt maru-uüa dawnglang chekhai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:52-53 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Haraw hai Menuhawt maru-uüa dawnglang chekhai </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown uowi mih chim dowi chekhai.</char></note>. <verse eid="1CH 2:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 2:53" />Now Kiriat-Jearim marow kowi kowh uowi mih krungchakuüa dow Ithrit, Puthit, Sumathit hai Misrait büah chekhai. (Zorat hai Estaawl krungchak uang phaw mih dow Kiriat-Jearim kowh krungchakuüa hownia chekhai).<verse eid="1CH 2:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 2:54" />Salma krungchakuüa dow Bethlehemuüa, Netawfatuüa, Atarawt-Bet-Joabuüa (Manahat maru dawnglang) hai Zorituüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 2:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 2:55" />(Now Jabez marow kowi kowh uowi miuüa dow Tiratuüa, Simeatuüa hai Sukatuüa chekhai. Amatni dow chabowih prim kowi kowh laiklow natama dowi kownkow plan rui iawk miuüa chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow Hamat krungchak chekhai. Hamat dow Ken krungchak Rekab kowh pa chekhai).<verse eid="1CH 2:55" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1CH 3" />
  <para style="s">Mang David kowh chapauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 3:1" />Maiawngün dow Hebrawn marow kowi kowh dia mih David kowh chapauüa chekhai. Amasi Ahinoam hown kowh aia rik kaah mih chapa dow Amnawn chekhai. Amasi dow Jezrel marow hownia kowh chekhai. Amasi Abigail hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa dow Daniel<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Daniel </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming 2 Samuel 3:3 kowi dow Kileab pahai arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> chekhai. Aia dow Karmel marow hownia kowh masiuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 3:2" />Amasi Maka hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa dow Absalawm chekhai. Maka dow Gesur pren mang Talmai chama chekhai. Amasi Hagit hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa dow Adonija chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 3:3" />Amasi Abital hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa dow Sefatia chekhai. Amasi Egla hown kowh aia ta kaah mih chapa dow Itream chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 3:4" />David dow Hebrawn marow kowi ranit ning hown dawnglang mowr chowmla mang khai. Naiawngün chapauüa taruk ia mih dow Hebrawn marow kowi aia kala mih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 3:4">Now Jerusalem marow kowi paw 33 ning mowr David chowmla mang khai. <verse eid="1CH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 3:5" />Nakowi paw aia dow kala chapa laisum ia khai. Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi tali ia mih dow Amiel chama Betseba hown kowh aia kaah mih chekhai. Naiawngün chapauüa ming dow Simea, Sabab, Nathan hai Sawlawmawn büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 3:6" />Now akeng mih masi hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa taku ia mih dow Ibat, Elisua, Elpelet, <verse eid="1CH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 3:7" />Nawga, Nefek, Jafia, <verse eid="1CH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 3:8" />Elisama, Eliada hai Elifelet büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 3:9" />Naiawngün dow David kowh chapauüa chekhai. Naiawngün klen kowi paw aia dow aia changla masi mih narma hown kala chapa akawmma tak chekhai. Aia kowh dow Tamar pami chama uowi lowk iachow taih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 3:10" />Now Sawlawmawn kowh chapa dow Rehoboam, Rehoboam kowh chapa dow Abija, Abija kowh chapa dow Asa, Asa kowh chapa dow Jehosafat, <verse eid="1CH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 3:11" />Jehosafat kowh chapa dow Jehoram, Jehoram kowh chapa dow Ahazia, Ahazia kowh chapa dow Joas, <verse eid="1CH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 3:12" />Joas kowh chapa dow Amazia, Amazia kowh chapa dow Uzia, Uzia kowh chapa dow Jotawm, <verse eid="1CH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 3:13" />Jotawm kowh chapa dow Ahaz, Ahaz kowh chapa dow Hezekia, Hezekia kowh chapa dow Manase, <verse eid="1CH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 3:14" />Manase kowh chapa dow Amawn, Amawn kowh chapa dow Josia, <verse eid="1CH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 3:15" />Josia kowh chapa ta dow Juhanawn, nami kung kowi dow Jehoiakim, Jehoiakim kung kowi dow Zedekia, now Zedekia kung kowi dow Jehoahaz<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jehoahaz </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming Salum pahai paw akeng Baibul kowi arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 3:16" />Jehoiakim kowh chapauüa dow Jehoiakin hai Zedekia iüah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiakin kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 3:17" />Mang Jehoiakin kowi dow khümla now Babulawn pren kowi pawla khai. Aia kowh chapauüa dow Sealtiel, <verse eid="1CH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 3:18" />Malkiram, Pedaia, Senezar, Jekamia, Hosama hai Nedabia büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 3:19" />Now Pedaia kowh chapauüa dow Zerubabel hai Simei iüah chekhai. Now Zerubabel kowh chapa dow Mesulam hai Hanani iüah chekhai, now achama dow Selomit chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 3:20" />Nami klen kowi Zerubabel kowh dow chapa uowi tanga ia tak chekhai. Naiawngün dow Hasuba, Awhel, Berekia, Hasadia hai Jusab-Hesed büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 3:21" />Now Hanani kowh chapa dow Pelatia hai Jesaia iüah chekhai. Jesaia kowh chapa dow Refaia, Refaia kowh chapa dow Arnan, Arnan kowh chapa dow Obadia, now Obadia kowh chapa Sekania chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 3:22" />Sekania kowh krungchak dow taruk ia chekhai. Naiawngün dow achapa Semaia hai Semaia kowh chapa Hatus, Igal, Baria, Nearia hai Safat büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 3:23" />Now Nearia kowh chapa sum ia mih dow Eliawenai, Hizkia hai Azrikam büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 3:24" />Now Eliawenai kowh chapa ranit ia mih dow Hodavia, Eliasib, Pelaia, Akub, Johana, Delatia hai Anani büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 3:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1CH 4" />
  <para style="s">Juda krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 4:1" />Juda krungchak maru-uüa dow Perez, Hezrawn, Karmi, Hur hai Sobal büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 4:2" />Sobal kowh chapa dow Reaia, Reaia kowh chapa dow Jahat, now Jahat kowh chapauüa dow Ahumai hai Lahad iüah chekhai. Amatni dow Zorat krungchakuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 4:3" />Etam kowh chapauüa dow Jezrel, Isma, Idbas (amatni kowh tuamow ming dow Hazelelponi chekhai), <verse eid="1CH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 4:4" />Penuel (achapa dow Gedawr) hai Ezer (achapa dow Husa) büah chekhai. Amatni dow Efrat kowh chapa ta Hur krungchakuüa chekhai. Hur dow Bethlehem marow thawp miia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 4:5" />Tekoa kowh chapa Asur kowh dow masi uowi pre ma chekhai. Aming dow Hela hai Nara iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 4:6" />Nara hown kowh Asur kaah mih chapauüa dow Ahuzam, Hefer, Temeni hai Ha-Ahastari büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 4:7" />Now Hela hown kowh Asur kaah mih chapauüa dow Zeret, Izhar, Etnan <verse eid="1CH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 4:8" />hai Kawz büah chekhai. Kawz kowh chapauüa dow Anub hai Zobeba iüah chekhai. Kawz dow Harum kowh chapa Aharhel krungchakuüa kowi prekcheah miia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 4:9" />Jabez pami maru uowi lowk ia. Aia dow atainau-uüa lak-e ringkawra uowima mih maru chekhai. Aia uang dia khe a-u tek mih, “Jabez kowi dow akratma ang penah mih chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 4:10" />Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi hawah now Jabez tek pe mih, “Pe ang prasi diah, now dawngthawnguan ahuma pe ang diah. En kowh kür mih ang tut-e patawi uowi reng lah, now ang nangarela dowi kownkow phih maten hownia lawng ang reng diah,” pakhai. Now Thurai mih Jabez awr lü iawng chang pe khai.<verse eid="1CH 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 4:11" />Suha kowh taimow Kelub kowh chapa dow Mehir, now Mehir kowh chapa dow Estawn chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 4:12" />Now Estawn kowh chapauüa dow Betrafa, Pasea hai Tehina büah chekhai; amatni dow Reka kuachak kangowh chekhai. Now Tehina dow Nahas kua thawp miia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 4:13" />Kenaz kowh chapauüa dow Awtniel hai Seraia iüah chekhai. Now Awtniel kowh chapauüa dow Hathat hai Meawnothai iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 4:14" />Meawnothai kowh chapa dow Awfra, now Seraia kowh chapa dow Joab chekhai. Joab dow Ge-Harasim kua thawp miia chekhai. Nami kua ming Ge-Harasim pahai chap pe mih auan dow nami kuachakuüa mih uanh thawp kiakma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 4:15" />Jefune chapa Kaleb kowh chapauüa dow Iru, Ela hai Naam büah chekhai. Now Ela kowh chapa ming dow Kenaz chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 4:16" />Jehalelel kowh chapauüa dow Zif, Zifa, Tiria hai Asarel büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 4:17" />Ezra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mami uan </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kowi kowh laiklow mih Hebrai lai hown chim dowi chekhai.</char></note> kowh chapauüa dow Jether, Mered, Efer hai Jalawn büah chekhai. Mered kowh dow masi uowi pre ma chekhai. Lowk ia mih dow Faraw kowh chama Bithia, now alowk mih dow Juda krungchak masiuüa chekhai. Bithia hown kowh Mered kaah mih chapa dow Samai hai Isba iüah chekhai, now achama dow Miriam chekhai. Isba dow Estemua pami kua thawp miia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 4:18" />Now Juda krungchak masiuüa hown kowh Mered kaah mih chapauüa dow Jered, Heber hai Jekuthiel büah chekhai. Jered dow Gedawr kua thawp miia, Heber dow Soko kua thawp miia, now Jekuthiel dow Zanoa kua thawp miia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 4:19" />Hodia dow Naham kowh tuamow hown ka chapa pre ia khai. Achapa lowk ia mih dow Garmit krungchakuüa kowh prekche miia Keilah kowh pa chekhai, now alowk mih dow Makat krungchakuüa kowh prekche miia Estemua kowh pa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 4:20" />Simawn kowh chapauüa dow Amnawn, Rina, Ben-Hanan hai Tilawn büah chekhai. Now Isi kowh chapauüa dow Zohet hai Ban-Zohet iüah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sela krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 4:21" />Juda kowh chapauüa pungmadawng kowi Sela pami uowi lowk ia chekhai. Sela kowh krungchakuüa dow Er (Er dow Leka kowh pa), Maresa (Maresa dow Lada kowh pa) hai Bet-Asbea kua kowi kowh adipükchow mih la hown kowh uan kawng miuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 4:22" />Jokim, Kozeba marowchakuüa, Joas hai Saraf büah paw Sela krungchak chekhai. Joas hai Saraf iüah dow Moab hai Jasubi-Lehem marow kruitown mih chekhai. (Maiawngün ming maten dow krungchakuüa ming tang bowih aprimma mih kowi arui uowi chekhai). <verse eid="1CH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 4:23" />Sela krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Netaim hai Gedera marow kowi uowi miuüa dow bawn hown kowh pu bia aikam thawp mih chekhai. Naiawngün marow kowi amatni uowi mih dow mang kowi nachang pe lup kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Simiawn krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 4:24" />Simiawn kowh chapauüa dow Nemuel, Jamin, Jarib, Zera hai Sawl büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 4:25" />Sawl kowh chapa dow Salum, Salum kowh chapa dow Mibsam, now Mibsam kowh chapa dow Misma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 4:26" />Misma kowh chapa dow Hamuel, Hamuel kowh chapa dow Zakur, now Zakur kowh chapa dow Simei chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 4:27" />Simei kowh dow chapa uowi laitaruk ia, now chama uowi taruk ia chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia tainau-uüa kowh dow chapa uowi hu dowi. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Juda krungchakuüa iawng maru iun kawm dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:27" /><verse number="28-31" style="v" sid="1CH 4:28-31" />Simiawn krungchakuüa uowi mih marow dow Ber-Seba, Molada, Hazar-Sual, Biha, Ezem, Tolad, Bethuel, Hawrma, Ziklak, Bet-Markabawt, Hazarsusim, Betbiri hai Saraim kowi chekhai. David chowm mang mowr dow naiawngün marow mih amatni kowh chowreng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:28-31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 4:32" />Nami klen kowi amatni dow Etam, Ain, Rimawn, Token hai Asan marow kowi paw uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 4:33" />Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh kua maten kowi paw Balat marow mowr uowi büah chekhai. Naiawngün arah kowi uowi büah hanow amatni kowh ming mih krungchakuüa ming tang bowih kowi ruiah büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 4:34" />Simiawn krungchakuüa kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Mesobab, Jamlek, Amazia kowh chapa Josa, <verse eid="1CH 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 4:35" />Joel, Jehu, (Jehu kowh pa dow Josibia, Josibia kowh pa dow Seraia, Seraia kowh pa dow Asiel chekhai) <verse eid="1CH 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 4:36" />Eliawenai, Jakoba, Jesohaia, Asaia, Adiel, Jesimiel, Benaia hai <verse eid="1CH 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 4:37" />Ziza büah chekhai. Ziza kowh pa dow Siphi, Siphi kowh pa dow Alawn, Alawn kowh pa dow Jedaia, Jedaia kowh pa dow Simri, Simri kowh pa dow Semaia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 4:38" />Amatni kowh krungchak dow lainowmma prung khai. <verse eid="1CH 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 4:39" />Naiawng rakowi amatni dow amatni kowh tawncher thing rah süng nakrawi mü kownkow lawngrawi satlawt pra kowh Gedawr süng kowi cham tarü khai, <verse eid="1CH 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 4:40" />now nakowi dow pram aiungma mih rah kowkrum büah khai. Nami arah dow aphiama chekhai, now thaulangma hai rarim raramma mih arah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 4:40">Nami dowi rawn khe dow nami arah kowi mih Ham krungchakuüa uowi sangrum chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 4:41" />Tawkche Juda pren kowi Hezekia chowm mang khe Simiawn krungchakuüa mih Hamuüa uowi rah kowi kowsenah hanow kowpowngta pe khai. Nami klen kowi amatni dow nakowi kowh uowi mih Meuniuüa kowi paw senah hanow asaima piakta khai. Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih naiawngün maru-uüa uowi rah kowi uowi büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow naiawngün süng kowi dow amatni kowh tawncher thing müa pram uowi ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 4:42" />Simiawn krungchak hownia maru iun 500 ia Seir pami hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi kowsenah khai. Nakhowk khe kowh amatni kowh aluchowuüa dow Isi kowh chapa Pelatia, Ne-Aria, Refaia hai Uziel büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 4:43" />Nami dowi rawn khe dow Amalekuüa mih nami Seir pami süng kowi uang uowi khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa maten kowi uang saita bowk hanow Simiawn krungchakuüa mih nakowi uowi büah khai. Amatni dow ani mowr nakowi uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 4:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1CH 5" />
  <para style="s">Reuben krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 5:1" />Jakawb kowh chapa ta Reuben dow a-pa changla masi mih narma hown taphua taiua khai. Naiawng rakowi Reuben dow aia kowh chapa ta rah ka dowi chekhai. Akung kowi nami chapa ta rah dow anaumow Josef kowh chapauüa kowi Thurai peta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow Israel krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi chapa ta pahai klowkla dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 5:2" />Amatni tainau krungchak pungmadawng kowi lang kür mih dow Juda krungchak chowdiah, now Juda krungchak hownia aluchow paw klota khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw chapa ta rah ka mih dow Josef chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 5:3" />Jakawb chapa ta Reuben kowh chapauüa dow Hanawk, Pallu, Hezrawn hai Karmi büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 5:4" />Joel kowh chapa dow Semaia chekhai. Semaia kowh chapa Gawg, Gawg kowh chapa Simei, <verse eid="1CH 5:4" /><verse number="5-6" style="v" sid="1CH 5:5-6" />Simei kowh chapa Mika, Mika kowh chapa Reaia, Reaia kowh chapa Baal, now Baal kowh chapa dow Bera chekhai. Bera dow Reuben krungchakuüa kowh aluchow chekhai. Aia kowi dow Asuria pren mang Tiglat-Pileser mih khümla khai.<verse eid="1CH 5:5-6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7-8" style="v" sid="1CH 5:7-8" />Reuben krungchak ming dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak taken iawng krungchakuüa ming tang bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh lang pankri miuüa dow Jeiel, Zekaria hai Azaz kowh chapa Bela büah chekhai. Azaz dow Sema kowh chapa chekhai, now Sema dow Joel kowh chapa chekhai. Amatni dow Arawer marow hownia Nebo marow hai Baal-Meawn marow mowr uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:7-8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 5:9" />Now satlawt pra kowh Iufratis aw hownia süngrüp süngkangma pra kowh mangla mih tiama mowr uowi büah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Gilead süng kowi dow amatni kowh tawncher hu mih nowm khowk chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 5:10" />Sawl chowm mang mih khin khe Reuben krungchakuüa dow Hagrituüa kowi senah hanow kowngta büah khai. Amatni dow Gileaduüa süng satlawt prakowi kowh Hagrituüa kowh arah maten powngta pe hanow nakowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gad krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 5:11" />Gad krungchakuüa dow Reuben krungchakuüa hown kowh tatang klowk mih Basan pren kowi kowh Saleka marow mowr uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 5:12" />Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh lang pankri mih dow Joel chekhai. Now Joel kung kowi dow Safam, Janai hai Safat büah chekhai. Amatni kowh uowi rah dow Basan pren kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 5:13" />Amatni kowh tasin taken miuüa dow Mikael, Mesulam, Seba, Jorai, Jakan, Zia hai Eber büah chekhai. Naiawngün ranit ia mih dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 5:14" />Amatni dow Hur kowh chapa Abihail krungchak maru-uüa chekhai. Hur kowh pa dow Jaroa, Jaroa kowh pa dow Gilead, Gilead kowh pa dow Mikael, Mikael kowh pa dow Jesisai, Jesisai kowh pa dow Jado, now Jado kowh pa dow Buz chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 5:15" />Abdiel chapa Ahi dow amatni krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Now Abdiel dow Guni kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 5:16" />Gad krungchakuüa dow Gilead pren kowi, Basan pren kowi hai nakowi kowh marow kowi krawi uowi büah khai. Nami klen kowi Sarawn süng kowi kowh tawncher thing rah maten kowi ün krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 5:17" />Maiawngün krungchakuüa ming dow krungchakuüa ming tang bowih kowi arui uowi chekhai. Naiawng ming tang bowih kowi ruiah mih dow Juda pren mang Jotham hai Israel pren mang Jeroboam iüah chowm mang mih khin khe chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Satlawt pra kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 5:18" />Reuben krungchak, Gad krungchak hai Manase krungchak dawnglang hownia dow tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa uowi 44,760 ia chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow kawngma, saidawng hai salangba tawngkeng akiakma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 5:19" />Amatni dow Hagar chenchap Jeturuüa, Nafisuüa hai Nodabuüa hown tasen khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 5:20" />Naiawngün maru-uüa hown tasen mih khin khe amatni dow chup Thurai khai, now Thurai dow amatni awr lüah mih hawt sünta pe khai. Amatni dow Thurai luk kowi neplawng nesak khai rakowi amatni kowi dow Thurai tawi khowngah khai. Hagar chenchap hai aia prakowi kowh tawi tangi mih maru-uüa maten kowi dow Thurai mih amatni rut kowi apta pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 5:21" />Amatni dow Hagar chenchap kowh Ut 50,000 pum, ruapur 250,000 pum hai kawrngaramchük 2,000 pum pawta pe khai, now maru iun 100,000 ia khümla büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 5:22" />Nami klen kowi ransu-uüa kowng mih paw ahuma tak chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami tasenra uang ting mih dow Thurai kamrütra hownia kowh chekhai. Reuben krungchak, Gad krungchak hai Manase krungchak dawnglang dow nar kowi takhang mih khin uang ting dowi mowr Basan pren kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 5:23" />Manase krungchak dawnglang dow maru iun akawmma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow Basan pren hownia Bal-Hermawn hungh, Senir hungh hai Hermawn hungh mowr krawi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 5:24" />Amatni krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Efer, Isi, Eliel, Azriel, Jeremia, Hodavia hai Jadiel büah chekhai. Naiawngün tasen akürma miuüa dow aming anang pawma mih maru-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 5:25" />Nachenganchepaw amatni dow amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kaah sakowm dowi mih lup chang büah khai. Amatni dow Thurai piakah mih chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa kowi cham tawi chupiia khai. <verse eid="1CH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 5:26" />Naiawng rakowi Israeluüa kowh Thurai mih Asuria pren mang Tiglat-Pileser kowi amatni luk kowi towkah kunmarau khai. Tiglat-Pileser kowh ming uowi lowk tak mih dow Pul chekhai. Now Tiglat-Pileser dow Reubenuüa, Manase krungchakuüa dawnglang hai Gaduüa kowi khümla hanow Hala, Habawr, Hara süng kowi hai Gozan aw pang kowi ün pawla khai. Now amatni dow kawmat paw nakowi uowi reng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 5:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1CH 6" />
  <para style="s">Levi krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 6:1" />Levi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn, Kohat hai Merari büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 6:2" />Kohat kowh chapauüa dow Amram, Izhar, Hebrawn hai Uziel büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 6:3" />Amram kowh chapa dow Arawn hai Mosi iüah chekhai, now achama ming dow Miriam chekhai. Arawn kowh chapauüa dow Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar hai Ithamar büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 6:4" />Eleazar kowh chapa dow Finehas. Finehas kowh chapa dow Abisua. <verse eid="1CH 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 6:5" />Abisua kowh chapa dow Buki. Buki kowh chapa dow Uzi. <verse eid="1CH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 6:6" />Uzi kowh chapa dow Zerahia. Zerahia kowh chapa dow Meraiawt. <verse eid="1CH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 6:7" />Meraiawt kowh chapa dow Amaria. Amaria kowh chapa dow Ahitub. <verse eid="1CH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 6:8" />Ahitub kowh chapa dow Zadawk. Zadawk kowh chapa dow Ahimaz. <verse eid="1CH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 6:9" />Ahimaz kowh chapa dow Azaria. Azaria kowh chapa dow Johanan. <verse eid="1CH 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 6:10" />Johanan kowh chapa dow Azaria. Azaria dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh mang Sawlawmawn thawpah mih Thurai chup kim kowi kowh uamow lang kri mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 6:11" />Azaria kowh chapa dow Amaria. Amaria kowh chapa dow Ahitub. <verse eid="1CH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 6:12" />Ahitub kowh chapa dow Zadawk. Zadawk kowh chapa dow Salum. <verse eid="1CH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 6:13" />Salum kowh chapa dow Hilkia. Hilkia kowh chapa dow Azaria. <verse eid="1CH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 6:14" />Azaria kowh chapa dow Seraia. Seraia kowh chapa dow Jehozadawk chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 6:15" />Juda prenchakuüa hai Jerusalem marowchakuüa kowi Nebuknezar rut kowi CHAKRAMANG ap-ah mih khin khe Jehozadawk kowi paw Nebuknezar khümla khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 6:16" />Levi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn, Kohat hai Merari büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 6:17" />Gersawn kowh chapauüa dow Libni hai Simei chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 6:18" />Kohat kowh chapauüa dow Amram, Izhar, Hebrawn hai Uziel büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 6:19" />Merari kowh chapauüa dow Mali hai Musi iüah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:19">Maiawngünuüa dow Levi krungchak kowi kowh chowlowkkow machak aluchowuüa chekhai: <verse eid="1CH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 6:20" />Gersawn kowh krungchakuüa dow Libni, Jahat, Zima, <verse eid="1CH 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 6:21" />Joa, Ido, Zera hai Jeatherai büah chekhai; <verse eid="1CH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 6:22" />Kohat kowh krungchakuüa dow Aminadab, Kora, Asir, <verse eid="1CH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 6:23" />Elkana, Abiasaf, Asir, <verse eid="1CH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 6:24" />Tahat, Uriel, Uzia hai Sawl chekhai; <verse eid="1CH 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 6:25" />Elkana kowh chapa dow Amasai hai Ahimawt, <verse eid="1CH 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 6:26" />now Ahimawt kowh chuprek chaprekuüa dow Elkana, Zofai, Nahat, <verse eid="1CH 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 6:27" />Eliab, Jeroham, alowk mih Elkana hai Samuel büah chekhai; <verse eid="1CH 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 6:28" />Samuel kowh chapa lang ta mih dow Joel, now asawi mih dow Abija chekhai; <verse eid="1CH 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 6:29" />Merari kowh krungchakuüa dow Mali, Libni, Simei, Uza, <verse eid="1CH 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 6:30" />Simea, Hagia hai Asaia büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh meng sarauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 6:31" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG kim kowi uang pawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kung kowi dow nakowi natek meng kown mih vüi David tow pe meng sarauüa khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 6:32" />Mang Sawlawmawn thawp CHAKRAMANG kim dowi mowr naiawngün meng sarauüa dow taklowp taklangra te pur kowi meng hown kiow Thurai büah reng chekhai. Amatni dow amatni kowi kowh peah ana mih iawng chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 6:33" />Maiawngünuüa dow meng sara aluchowuüa kowh krungchakuüa ming chekhai:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 6:33">Kohat krungchak hownia kowh meng sara aluchow mih dow Joel chapa Heman chekhai. Heman kowh pa dow Joel, Joel kowh pa dow Samuel, <verse eid="1CH 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 6:34" />Samuel kowh pa dow Elkana, Elkana kowh pa dow Jeroham, Jeroham kowh pa dow Eliel, Eliel kowh pa dow Toa, <verse eid="1CH 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 6:35" />Toa kowh pa dow Zuf, Zuf kowh pa dow Elkana, Elkana kowh pa dow Mahat, Mahat kowh pa dow Amasai, Amasai kowh pa dow Azaria, <verse eid="1CH 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 6:36" />Azaria kowh pa Zefania, Zefania kowh pa dow Tahat, <verse eid="1CH 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 6:37" />Tahat kowh pa dow Asir, Asir kowh pa dow Abiasaf, Abiasaf kowh pa dow Kora, <verse eid="1CH 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 6:38" />Kora kowh pa dow Izhar, Izhar kowh pa dow Kohat, Kohat kowh pa dow Levi, now Levi kowh pa dow Israel chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 6:39" />Asaf dow Gersawn krungchak hownia kowh chekhai. Aia dow Heman kowh akhowng mih chekhai. Asaf kowh pa dow Berekia, Berekia kowh pa dow Simea, <verse eid="1CH 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 6:40" />Simea kowh pa dow Mikael, Mikael kowh pa dow Baseia, Baseia kowh pa dow Malkija, <verse eid="1CH 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 6:41" />Malkija kowh pa dow Etni, Etni kowh pa dow Zera, Zera kowh pa dow Adaia, <verse eid="1CH 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 6:42" />Adaia kowh pa dow Ethan, Ethan kowh pa dow Zima, Zima kowh pa dow Simei, <verse eid="1CH 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 6:43" />Simei kowh pa dow Jahat, Jahat kowh pa dow Gersawn, now Gersawn kowh pa dow Levi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 6:44" />Ethan dow Merari krungchak hownia kowh chekhai. Aia dow Heman kowh alowk mih akhowng mih chekhai. Ethan kowh pa dow Kisi, Kisi kowh pa dow Abdi, Abdi kowh pa dow Maluk, <verse eid="1CH 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 6:45" />Maluk kowh pa dow Hasabia, Hasabia kowh pa dow Amazia, Amazia kowh pa dow Hilkia, <verse eid="1CH 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 6:46" />Hilkia kowh pa dow Amzi, Amzi kowh pa dow Bani, Bani kowh pa dow Semer, <verse eid="1CH 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 6:47" />Semer kowh pa dow Mali, Mali kowh pa dow Musi, Musi kowh pa dow Merari, now Merari kowh pa dow Levi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="1CH 6:48" />Amatni kowh tainau akeng mih Leviuüa dow taklowp taklangra te kowi nachang lup kown mih takhowm tabowk khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Arawn krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="1CH 6:49" />Levi krungchak kowi kowh chang uamow lup mih dow Arawn hai aia krungchakuüa ngetchow taih. Amatni dow Thurai nar Mosi ana pek iawng rowprowp chang lup reng chekhai. Amatni dow phuchuara luk kowi tikah mih uanap chang reng, now anam iungma mih maikhük ün phuchuara luk kowi towk büah reng chekhai. Nami klen kowi Lang Chimsai Mih Arah kowi kowh achang takla mih srui chang büah reng, now Israeluüa kowh angak nalawtta pe kownkow angak lawt lük müa uanap ün chang pe büah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="1CH 6:50" />Maiawngünuüa dow Arawn chuprek chaprekuüa chekhai. Arawn kowh chapa dow Eleazar, Eleazar kowh chapa dow Finehas, Finehas kowh chapa dow Abisua, <verse eid="1CH 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="1CH 6:51" />Abisua kowh chapa dow Buki, Buki kowh chapa dow Uzi, Uzi kowh chapa dow Zerahia, <verse eid="1CH 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="1CH 6:52" />Zerahia kowh chapa dow Meraiawt, Meraiawt kowh chapa dow Amaria, Amaria kowh chapa dow Ahitub, <verse eid="1CH 6:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="1CH 6:53" />Ahitub kowh chapa dow Zadawk, now Zadawk kowh chapa dow Ahimaz chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi krungchakuüa kowh marow</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="1CH 6:54" />Mami dow Levi chenchap Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kuak plang hanow Arawn krungchakuüa kaah mih marow hai tawncher thing rah dowm chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="1CH 6:55" />Amatni dow Juda krungchak hownia Hebrawn marow hai aria aret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng ka khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="1CH 6:56" />Tawkchedow Hebrawn marow kowi kowh kua hai süng dow Jefune chapa Kaleb kowi peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="1CH 6:57" />Arawn krungchakuüa kowi dow changla tatung tanimra marow mih Hebrawn, Libna, Jatir, Estemua, <verse eid="1CH 6:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="1CH 6:58" />Hawlawn, Debir, <verse eid="1CH 6:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="1CH 6:59" />Ain, Juta hai Bet-Semes marow peah khai; amatni kowi dow naiawngün marow hai aria aret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw pela khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="1CH 6:60" />Nami klen kowi Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali klüng mih marow dow Gibeawn, Geba, Anathawt hai Almawn chekhai; naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. Naiawng hai uamow Arawn krungchakuüa kaah mih marow dow bowkbowk kowi laisum buk chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 6:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="1CH 6:61" />Now Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh akeng mih krungchakuüa dow Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia ka marow hamüt klüng khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="1CH 6:62" />Gersawn krungchakuüa dow Isakar krungchak, Aser krungchak, Naptali krungchak hai Basan pren kowi kowh Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia ka marow laisum buk khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="1CH 6:63" />Now Merari krungchakuüa dow Reuben krungchak, Gad krungchak hai Zebulun krungchak hownia ka marow laipre buk khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="1CH 6:64" />Naiawng hai Israeluüa dow naiawngün marow hai tawncher thing rah süng mih Levi krungchakuüa kowi peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="1CH 6:65" />Israeluüa dow kuak palang khe kowh ming uang tatüng iawng Leviuüa kowi Juda krungchak, Simiawn krungchak hai Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh marow peah khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:65" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="1CH 6:66" />Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh maru sangrum mih dow Efraim krungchakuüa kowh süng hownia ka marow sangrum khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="1CH 6:67" />Efraim krungchakuüa kowh hungma mawngma süng kowi kowh amatni kaah mih marow dow changla tatung tanimra mih Sekem, Gezer, <verse eid="1CH 6:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="1CH 6:68" />Jawkmeam, Bet-Hawrawn, <verse eid="1CH 6:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="1CH 6:69" />Aijalawn hai Gat-Rimawn chekhai. Naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="1CH 6:70" />Tawkche Kohat krungchakuüa pungmadawng kowi akeng miuüa dow Manase krungchak dawnglang hownia Tanak hai Gat-Rimawn marow ka büah khai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="1CH 6:71" />Gersawn krungchakuüa dow Manase krungchak dawnglang mih hownia Astarawt marow hai Basan pren kowi kowh Golan marow ka pre buk khai. Now naiawngün marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:71" /><verse number="72-73" style="v" sid="1CH 6:72-73" />Isakar krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali klüng mih marow dow Kedes, Daberat, Ramawt hai Anem chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:72-73" /><verse number="74-75" style="v" sid="1CH 6:74-75" />Now Aser krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali klüng mih marow dow Misal, Abdawn, Helkat hai Rehawb chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai <verse eid="1CH 6:74-75" /><verse number="76" style="v" sid="1CH 6:76" />Now Naptali krungchakuüa süng hownia kowh amatni kaah mih sum buk mih marow dow Galili kowi kowh Kedes, Hamawt-Dawr hai Kartan chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:76" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="1CH 6:77" />Levi chenchap Merari krungchakuüa dow Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh süng hownia Jawkneam, Karta, Dimna hai Nahalal marow ka tali klüng khai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:77" /><verse number="78-79" style="v" sid="1CH 6:78-79" />Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh uowi mih Reuben krungchakuüa hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali klüng mih marow dow Bezer (Bezer dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh uowi mih chekhai), Jahaz, Kedemawt hai Mefat chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 6:78-79" /><verse number="80-81" style="v" sid="1CH 6:80-81" />Gad krungchakuüa hownia kowh amatni kaah mih tali klüng mih marow dow Mahanaim, Hesbawn, Jazer hai Gilead süng kowi kowh Ramawt chekhai. Now marow riaret kowi kowh tawncher thing rah süng paw kala bowk büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 6:80-81" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="1CH 7" />
  <para style="s">Isakar krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 7:1" />Isakar kowh chapa tali ia mih ming dow Tola, Pua, Jasub hai Simrawn büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 7:2" />Tola kowh chapauüa dow Uzi, Refaia, Jeriel, Jamai, Ibsam hai Semuel büah chekhai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. David chowm mang mih khin khe Tola krungchak kowi kowh ming rui uowi mih tasen kiakma miuüa dow 22,600 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 7:3" />Uzi kowh chapa dow Izrahia chekhai. Izrahia kowh chapauüa dow Mikhael, Obadia, Joel hai Isia büah chekhai. Amatni paw chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 7:4" />Amatni kowh dow masi chauüa akawmma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni krungchak hownia ming rui uowi mih tasen uang mih nget maru iun 36,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 7:5" />Isakar krungchak maten hownia kowh ming rui uowi mih tasen uang mih nget maru iun bowkbowk kowi 87,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Benjamin krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 7:6" />Benjamin kowh chapa sum ia mih dow Bela, Beker hai Jediael büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 7:7" />Bela kowh chapa tanga ia mih dow Ezbawn, Uzi, Uziel, Jerimawt hai Iri büah chekhai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. Amatni krungchak hownia ming rui uowi mih tasen kiakma mih nget dow 22,034 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 7:8" />Beker kowh chapauüa dow Zemira, Joas, Eliezer, Eliawenai, Awmri, Jeremawt, Abija, Anathawt hai Alemet büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 7:9" />Amatni kowh krungchak ming tang bowih kowi ming rui uowi mih dow tasen kiakma mih nget 20,200 ia hai aluchowuüa ming chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 7:10" />Jediael kowh chapa dow Bilhan chekhai. Now Bilhan kowh chapauüa dow Jeus, Benjamin, Ehud, Kenana, Zethan, Tarsis hai Ahisahar büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 7:11" />Jediael krungchak kowi naiawngünuüa dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow hai tasen kiakma miuüa chekhai. Amatni krungchak kowi kowh cham dowk tasen kown kamrütma mih tasen kiakma mih nget dow maru iun 17,200 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 7:12" />Ir kowh chapauüa dow Hupim hai Supim iüah chekhai, now Aher kowh chapa dow Husim chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naptali krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 7:13" />Naptali kowh chapauüa dow Jaziel, Guni, Jezer hai Salum büah chekhai. Amatni kowh u ming dow Bilha chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Manase krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 7:14" />Manase kowh chapauüa dow Asriel hai Gilead kowh pa Makir iüah chekhai. Kowiüah dow aia changla masi mih narma Aram chenchap masiuüa hown kowh Manase kaah mih chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 7:15" />Makir kowh dow masi uowi pre ma chekhai. Amatchi dow Hupim hai Supim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hupim hai Supim </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming pre buk mih dow aia kowh masi krungchak ming chepaw naia, now aia kowh chapauüa ming chepaw naia kown.</char></note> krungchak hownia kowh chekhai. Lowk mih masi ming dow Maka<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Maka </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow Makir kowh tuamow chepaw naia.</char></note>, now alowk mih ming dow Zelofehad chekhai. Amasi Zelofehad hown kowh aia kaah mih dow masiuüa kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 7:16" />Amasi Maka hown kowh aia kaah mih chapa ming dow Peres chekhai. Peres kowh naumow ming dow Seres, now achapauüa dow Ulam hai Rakem iüah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 7:17" />Ulam kowh chapa ming dow Bedan chekhai. Amatni dow Gilead krungchak maru chekhai. Gilead dow Makir kowh chapa, now Makir dow Manase kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 7:18" />Gilead kowh tuamow Hamoleket kowh chauüa dow Ishawd, Abiezer hai Mala büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 7:19" />Semida kowh chapauüa dow Ahian, Sekem, Likhi hai Aniam büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Efraim krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 7:20" />Efraim kowh chapa dow Suthela, Suthela kowh chapa dow Bered, Bered kowh chapa dow Tahat, Tahat kowh chapa dow Eleada, Eleada kowh chapa dow Tahat, <verse eid="1CH 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 7:21" />Tahat kowh chapa dow Zabad, now Zabad kowh chapa dow Suthela chekhai. Efraim kowh chapa uowi pre ia tak mih dow Ezer hai Elead iüah chekhai. Nachenganchepaw kowiüah dow Gat kowi cham ku tawncher khe Gat kowi kowh maru-uüa bawpah kowh kowng khai. <verse eid="1CH 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 7:22" />Amatchi vüi a-pa Efraim mih akrama uowila uiting uangtak khai. Nakhowk khe Efraim kowi aia kowh tasin taken miuüa uang tek pe sakklamra lai khai. <verse eid="1CH 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 7:23" />Nami kung kowi aia dow amasi hown plan taphua taiua hanow plan ka chapa lowk ia khai. Achapa ming dow Beria pahai a-pa Efraim rük pe khai. Beria pami auan dow “akrat” pami chekhai. Naiawng achapa ming aia rük pe mih dow nami khin khe aia kimchakuüa luk kowi akrat uang ting rakowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 7:24" />Efraim kowh chama ming dow Sira chekhai. Sira dow aluk Bet-Hawrawn hai adak Bet-Hawrawn hown Uzen-Sira kua thawp miia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 7:25" />Beria kowh chapa dow Refa, Refa kowh chapa dow Resef, Resef kowh chapa dow Tela, Tela kowh chapa dow Tahan, <verse eid="1CH 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 7:26" />Tahan kowh chapa dow Ladan, Ladan kowh chapa dow Amihud, Amihud kowh chapa dow Elisama, <verse eid="1CH 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 7:27" />Elisama kowh chapa dow Nun, now Nun kowh chapa dow Josua chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 7:28" />Efraim krungchakuüa kowh krawng bawn hai uowi rah dow Bethel hai aria aret kowi kowh kua, satlawt pra kowh Naran, satkup pra kowh Gezer hai aria aret kowi kowh kua ün chekhai. Nami klen kowi Sekem hai aria aret kowi kowh kua hownia Aiia hai aria aret kowi kowh kua mowr mih paw amatni kowh süng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 7:29" />Manase krungchak sünghi ria kowi kowh Bet-San, Tanak, Megido, Dawr marow hai aria aret kowi kowh kua maten paw Efraim krungchakuüa kowh süng chekhai. Naiawngün marow hai kua maten kowi uowi mih dow Israel kowh chapa Josef krungchakuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Aser krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 7:30" />Aser kowh chapauüa dow Imna, Isva, Isvi hai Beria büah chekhai. Now kowbüah kowh tuamow dow Sera chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 7:31" />Beria kowh chapauüa dow Heber hai Malkiel iüah chekhai. Malkiel kowh chapa dow Birzait chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 7:32" />Now Heber kowh chapauüa dow Jaflet, Somer hai Hotham büah chekhai. Now amatni kowh tuamow ming dow Sua chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 7:33" />Jaflet kowh chapauüa dow Pasak, Bemhal hai Asvat büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 7:34" />Somer kowh chapauüa dow Ahi, Roga, Huba hai Aram büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 7:35" />Somer kowh naumow Hotham<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hotham </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami tawngbak mih Baibul kowi dow Helem pahai paw arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> kowh chapauüa dow Zofa, Imna, Seles hai Amal büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 7:36" />Zofa kowh chapauüa dow Sua, Harnefer, Saul, Beri, Imra, <verse eid="1CH 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 7:37" />Bezer, Hawd, Sama, Silsa, Ithran hai Bera büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 7:38" />Jether kowh chapauüa dow Jefune, Pispa hai Ara büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 7:39" />Ula kowh chapauüa dow Ara, Haniel hai Rizia büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 7:40" />Naiawngünuüa dow Aser chuprek chaprek kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa kangowh chekhai. Amatni dow ruiah mih tasen kiakma miuüa kangowh hai chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa kowi lang kri miuüa kangowh chekhai. Krungchakuüa ming tang bowih kowi ming rui uowi mih Aser krungchak kowi kowh tasen uang miuüa maru iun dow 26,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 7:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="1CH 8" />
  <para style="s">Benjamin krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 8:1" />Now Benjamin kowh dow chapa uowi tanga ia chekhai. Aia kowh chapa ta dow Bela chekhai, nami kung kowi dow Asbel, Ahara, <verse eid="1CH 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 8:2" />Noha hai Rafa büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 8:3" />Now Bela kowh chapauüa dow Adar, Gera, Abihud, <verse eid="1CH 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 8:4" />Abisua, Naman, Ahoa, <verse eid="1CH 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 8:5" />Gera, Sefufan hai Huram büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6-7" style="v" sid="1CH 8:6-7" />Ehud kowh chapauüa dow Naman, Ahija hai Gera büah chekhai. Amatni dow Geba marow kowi kowh uowi mih maru-uüa kowh krungchak aluchowuüa chekhai. Tawkche amatni kowi dow nami Geba marow hownia prütta khai. Nahanow amatni dow Manahat marow kowi kowuowi büah khai. Nakhowk khe kowh kruitown mih dow Gera chekhai. Gera kowh chapauüa dow Uza hai Ahihud büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 8:6-7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="1CH 8:8-9" />Sahariam kowh masi uowi pre ma mih dow Husim hai Barak iüah chekhai. Tawkche Sahariam dow amasi pre ia kowi khuata khai, now aia dow Moab pren kowi kowh Hodes pami masiuüa kowi chawngah khai. Hodes hown kowh aia kaah mih chapauüa dow Jawbab, Zibia, Mesa, Malkam, <verse eid="1CH 8:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 8:10" />Jeuz, Sakia hai Mirma büah chekhai. Now Sahariam kowh chapauüa dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 8:11" />Nami klen kowi aia dow Husim hown paw plan ka chapa pre ia khai. Naiawngün dow Ahitub hai Elpal iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:11" /><verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CH 8:12-13" />Elpal kowh chapauüa dow Eber, Misam, Semed, Beria hai Sema büah chekhai. Sema dow Ono marow hai Lawd marow hailawm aria aret kowi kowh kua maten thawp miia chekhai. Beria hai Sema iüah dow Aijalawn marow kowi kowh krungchak aluchowuüa chekhai. Gat krungchakuüa kowi prütah mih dow kowiüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:12-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 8:14" />Baria kowh chapauüa dow Ahiaw, Sasak, Jeremawt, <verse eid="1CH 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 8:15" />Zebadia, Arad, Eder, <verse eid="1CH 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 8:16" />Mikael, Ispa hai Joha büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 8:17" />Now Elpal kowh chapauüa dow Zebadia, Mesulum, Hizki, Heber, <verse eid="1CH 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 8:18" />Ismerai, Izlia hai Jawbab büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 8:19" />Simei kowh chapauüa dow Jakim, Zikri, Zabdi, <verse eid="1CH 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 8:20" />Elienai, Zilethai, Eliel, <verse eid="1CH 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 8:21" />Adaia, Beraia hai Simrat büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 8:22" />Sasak kowh chapauüa dow Ispan, Eber, Eliel, <verse eid="1CH 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 8:23" />Abdawn, Zikri, Hanan, <verse eid="1CH 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 8:24" />Hanani, Elam, Anthawthija, <verse eid="1CH 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 8:25" />Ifdeia hai Penuel büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 8:26" />Jeroham kowh chapauüa dow Samserai, Seharia, Athalia, <verse eid="1CH 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 8:27" />Jaresia, Elija hai Zikri büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 8:28" />Maiawngün Benjamin krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Jerusalem marow kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 8:29" />Gibeawn kowh pa Jeiel uowi mih dow Gibeawn marow kowi chekhai. Jeiel kowh masi dow Maka chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 8:30" />Aia kowh chapa ta dow Abdawn chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Zur, Kis, Baal, Ner, Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 8:31" />Gedawr, Ahiaw, Zekaria <verse eid="1CH 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 8:32" />hai Miklawt büah chekhai. (Miklawt dow Simea kowh pa chekhai). Miklawt hai Simea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:32 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Miklawt hai Simea </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami lawnguan kowi Hebrai lai hown chim dowi. Jerusalem marow kowi mia chow uowi mih tukah dowi chekhai.</char></note> iüah dow Jerusalem kowi kowh amatni krungchakuüa hown taiua uowi khai.<verse eid="1CH 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang Sawl kowh krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 8:33" />Ner kowh chapa dow Kis, now Kis kowh chapa dow Sawl chekhai. Sawl kowh chapauüa dow Jonathan, Malkisua, Abinadab hai Esbaal büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 8:34" />Jonathan kowh chapa dow Merib-Baal, now Merib-Baal kowh chapa dow Mika chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 8:35" />Mika kowh chapauüa dow Pithawn, Melek, Tarea hai Ahaz büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 8:36" />Now Ahaz kowh chapa dow Jehuada, now Jehuada kowh chapauüa dow Alemet, Azmavet hai Zimri büah chekhai. Zimri kowh chapa dow Moza chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 8:37" />Moza kowh chapa dow Binea, Binea kowh chapa dow Rafa, Rafa kowh chapa dow Eleasa, now Eleasa kowh chapa dow Azel chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 8:38" />Azel kowh chapa uowi taruk ia mih dow Azrikam, Bokeru, Ismael, Searia, Obadia hai Hanan büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 8:39" />Now Azel naumow Esek kowh chapa ta dow Ulam chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Jeus hai Elifelet iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 8:40" />Ulam kowh chapauüa dow tasen kiakma hai salangba ap tukma kangowh chekhai. Amatni kowh chapauüa hai chu-uüa dow bowkbowk kowi 150 ia chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 8:40">Maiawngün dow Benjamin krungchakuüa kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="1CH 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 9:1" />Naiawng hai Israel krungchak maten kowh ming dow, “Israel Manguüa lawnguan,” pami bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1CH 9:1">Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan mih Israeluüa</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 9:1">CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm iawng uowi dowi rakowi Judauüa kowi dow Babulawnuüa khümla hanow amatni pren kowi pawla khai. <verse eid="1CH 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 9:2" />Cham <char style="w">takhangra</char> hownia uang rik mang hanow kowmatia marow kowi kowh kowmatia krawng bawn kowi uang uowi miuüa dow Israeluüa, uamowuüa, Leviuüa hai Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 9:3" />Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uang plan miuüa dow Juda krungchak sangrum, Benjamin krungchak sangrum, Efraim krungchak sangrum hai Manase krungchak sangrum chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 9:4" />Juda krungchak hownia kowh uang plan mih dow Juda chapa Perez kowh chuprek chaprek Uthai chekhai. Uthai kowh pa dow Amihud, Amihud kowh pa dow Awmri, Awmri kowh pa dow Imri, Imri kowh pa dow Bani, now Bani kowh pa dow Perez chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 9:5" />Juda chapa Sela krungchak hown kowh uang plan mih dow Asaia hai aia kowh chapauüa chekhai. Asaia dow Sela kowh chapa ta chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 9:6" />Juda chapa Zera krungchak hownia kowh uang plan mih dow Jeuel hai aia kowh tasin taken miuüa chekhai. Jerusalem marow kowi kowh uowi mih Juda krungchakuüa dow 690 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 9:7" />Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh uang plan mih dow Salu chekhai. Salu kowh pa dow Mesulam, Mesulam kowh pa dow Hodavia, now Hodavia kowh pa dow Hasenua chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 9:8" />Ibneia dow Jeroham kowh chapa chekhai. Ela dow Uzi kowh chapa, Uzi dow Mikri kowh chapa chekhai. Mesulam<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mesulam </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami dow 7 uan kowi kowh Mesulam nadowi chekhai.</char></note> dow Sefatia kowh chapa, Sefatia dow Reuel kowh chapa, now Reuel dow Ibnija kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 9:9" />Amatni dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Benjamin krungchak kowi kowh ming tang uowi iawng Jerusalem marow kowi amatni uowi mih dow 956 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan mih uamowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="1CH 9:10-11" />Uamowuüa hownia dow Jedaia, Jehoiarib, Jakin hai Thurai kim kowi nachang lup kownkow ka kurdik miuüa luk kowi kowh aluchow Azaria büah chekhai. Azaria dow Hilkia kowh chapa, Hilkia dow Mesulam kowh chapa, Mesulam dow Zadawk kowh chapa, Zadawk dow Meraiawt kowh chapa, now Meraiawt dow Ahitub kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:10-11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 9:12" />Nami klen kowi Adaia dow Jeroham kowh chapa, Jeroham dow Pasur kowh chapa, now Pasur dow Malkija kowh chapa chekhai. Masai dow Adiel kowh chapa, Adiel dow Jazera kowh chapa, Jazera dow Mesulam kowh chapa, Mesulam dow Mesilemit kowh chapa, now Mesilemit dow Imer kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 9:13" />Bowkbowk kowi uamowuüa hai amatni kowh tasin taken miuüa uang plan mih dow 1,760 ia chekhai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Amatni dow Thurai chup kim kowi nachang lup kownkow tataing mih maru-uüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan mih Leviuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 9:14" />Leviuüa hownia kowh Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih dow Semaia. Semaia dow Hasub kowh chapa, Hasub dow Azrikam kowh chapa, Azrikam dow Hasabia kowh chapa, now Hasabia dow Merari kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 9:15" />Nami klen kowi Bakbakar, Heres, Galal hai Matania paw Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih chekhai. Matania dow Mika kowh chapa, Mika dow Zikri kowh chapa, now Zikri dow Asap kowh chapa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 9:16" />Obadia paw Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih chekhai. Obadia dow Semaia kowh chapa, Semaia dow Galal kowh chapa, now Galal dow Jeduthun kowh chapa chekhai. Nami klen kowi Berekia paw Jerusalem kowi uang plan mih chekhai. Berekia dow Asa kowh chapa, now Asa dow Elkana chekhai. Berekia uowi mih dow Netawfatuüa kowh marow kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi kowh Thurai chup kim mingkhet miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17-19" style="v" sid="1CH 9:17-19" />Thurai chup kim chawng miuüa hownia Jerusalem kowi uang plan miuüa dow Salum, Akub, Talmawn, Ahiman hai amatni kowh krungchak maru-uüa chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow tangbung khupra kowi kowh kangchawng mih Levi krungchakuüa chekhai. Kore kowh chapa Salum dow amatni kowh aluchow chekhai. Kore dow Ebiasap kowh chapa chekhai, now Ebiasap dow Kora kowh chapa chekhai. Thurai chup kim kimplawt chawng mih kowi kowh ka kurdik miuüa dow Salum hai aia krungchak Korauüa chekhai. Kawmat paw amatni dow Thurai chup kim satlawt prakowi kowh mang uang kupla reng mih tapplawt kowi uowi büah reng tak chekhai. Amatni pipu-uüa luk kowi paw naiawng powm iawng CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra te plawt chawng kown mih kurdik uowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:17-19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 9:20" />Nami khin khe Eleazar kowh chapa Finehas dow amatni kowh aluchow chekhai, now CHAKRAMANG dow aia tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 9:21" />Maselemia kowh chapa Zekaria dow taklowp taklangra te plawt chawng mih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 9:22" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh kimplawt maten nachawng kownkow kloah mih maru-uüa dow bowkbowk kowi 212 ia chekhai. Amatni chowlowkkow kua kowi kowh krungchakuüa ming tang bowih kowi amatni kowh ming paw tawi uowi chekhai. Now klangiungma nachawng kimplawt kownkow amatni kowi dow mang David hai risi Samuel iüah towah mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 9:23" />Amatni hai amatni kowh krungchakuüa dow Thurai chup kim kimplawt maten chawng reng chekhai. Nami khin khe dow Thurai chup kim mih taklowp taklangra te chowreng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 9:24" />Nami kangchawng miuüa dow satlawt, satkup, tawngphak hai mrawkphak prakowi kowh kimplawt chawng reng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 9:25" />Now marow uat kowi kowh kua hownia amatni kowh tainau-uüa paw ranit ni chi amatni kowi uang tawi leah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 9:26" />Now Levi chenchap kangchawng miuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih tali ia luk kowi dow Thurai kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah towklak naming nakhet kown mih kurdik peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 9:27" />Amatni dow uar-e khe Thurai chup kim re-e uowi hüah khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni kowh kurdik dow Thurai chup kim naming nakhet kown hai rau murpa nauow kown mih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 9:28" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang müa tawngah mih uanh naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh pre sum ia mih luk kowi chekhai. Naiawngün uanh lawtla mih khin khe hai uang kupla khe amatni dow hawt rüaah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 9:29" />Now Thurai chup kim kowi kowh chimsaima mih uanh maten, bia, kawmdi, grep tui, kanrawn sau, anam iungma mih maikhük towk müa <char style="w">than</char> hai nam iungma mih chap maten naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow akeng mih Leviuüa luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 9:30" />Tawkche nam iungma mih chap maten nalawk kown mih kurdik dow uamowuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh pre sum ia miuüa luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 9:31" />Now kawmdi uanap chang müa uanh nathawp kownkow ka kurdik mih dow Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh Salum kowh chapa ta Matithia chekhai. Matithia dow Kora krungchak chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 9:32" />Now Tanai Ni khe chimsaima mih towklak kowi kowh pawitang luk kowi kowh natowah kown mih chimsaima mih kawm nathawp kownkow ka kurdik mih dow Leviuüa pungmadawng kowi pre sum ia mih Kohat krungchakuüa luk kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 9:33" />Now meng tek mih Levi krungchak aluchowuüa kowh uowi rah dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh amatni vüi lang tow pe mih towklak ün kowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow ni-e iak-e Thurai chup kim kowi meng tek takla khai. Naiawng rakowi amatni kowi dow akeng mih lup nachang kown mih kurdik peah dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 9:34" />Krungchak kowi kowh ming tang uowi iawng amatni bowkbowk dow Levi krungchak chekhai; amatni dow amatni chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Amatni uowi mih dow Jerusalem marow kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawl krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 9:35" />Gibeawn kowh pa Jeiel uowi mih dow Gibeawn marow kowi chekhai. Jeiel kowh masi dow Maka chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 9:36" />Aia kowh chapa ta dow Abdawn chekhai. Nami kung kowi dow Zur, Kis, Baal, Ner, Nadab, <verse eid="1CH 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 9:37" />Gedawr, Ahiaw, Zekaria hai Miklawt büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 9:38" />Miklawt kowh chapa dow Simeam chekhai. Amatni dow Jerusalem marow kowi kowh amatni krungchak maru-uüa tut-e tawi uowi khai.<verse eid="1CH 9:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 9:39" />Ner kowh chapa dow Kis, now Kis kowh chapa dow Sawl chekhai. Now Sawl kowh chapauüa dow Jonathan, Malkisua, Abinadab hai Esbaal büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 9:40" />Jonathan kowh chapa dow Baal, now Merib-Baal kowh chapa dow Mika chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 9:41" />Now Mika kowh chapauüa dow Pithawn, Melek, Tarea hai Ahaz büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 9:42" />Ahaz kowh chapa dow Jara chekhai. Now Jara kowh chapauüa dow Alemet, Azmavet hai Zimri büah chekhai. Zimri kowh chapa Moza, <verse eid="1CH 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 9:43" />Moza kowh chapa Binea, Binea kowh chapa Refaia, Refaia kowh chapa Eleasa, now Eleasa kowh chapa dow Azel chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 9:44" />Azel kowh dow chapa uowi taruk ia chekhai. Achapauüa dow Azrikam, Bokeru, Ismael, Searia, Obadia hai Hanan büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 9:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="1CH 10" />
  <para style="s">Mang Sawl kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 10:1" />Filistinuüa hown Israeluüa tasen khe Israeluüa mih Filistinuüa pur hownia powt khai. Nakhowk khe tawngbak mih dow Gilboa hungh kowi Filistinuüa rut kowi kowng ne chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 10:2" />Filistinuüa mih Sawl hai achapauüa kowi kawikrawiah hanow achapa Jonathan, Abinadab hai Malkisua büah kowi saita khai. <verse eid="1CH 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 10:3" />Nami kung kowi paw Israeluüa hown Filistinuüa mih lainowmma tasen reng tak chekhai. Nakhowk khe leba dowk mih siphaiuüa mih Sawl kowi khita hanow ap-ah khai.<verse eid="1CH 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 10:4" />Nakhowk khe aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai kowi Sawl tek pe mih, “En kowh saidawng hown saita ang bowt. Naiawng nadowi now pai iawngün hiah khampha uanpik dowi mih maru-uüa uangah now nauang saita ang kown chowbowt, now nakhare ang büah kown chekhai,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 10:4">Nachenganchepaw aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai dow naiawng nachang kown mih nauta dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lainowmma kram khai. Naiawng rakowi Sawl mih aia kowh saidawng howkah now aia matia tasawt khai. <verse eid="1CH 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 10:5" />Now Sawl kowng khai bowt mih khita hanow aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dowk mih siphai paw aiamat kowh saidawng hown aia matia tasawt khai, now aia paw Sawl hown tawi taiua kowng khai. <verse eid="1CH 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 10:6" />Naiawng hai nami ni dow Sawl hai achapa sum ia hown aia kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng uai mih siphai hailawm akeng miuüa paw tawi kowng sangrum khai.<verse eid="1CH 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 10:7" />Naiawng Sawl hai achapauüa kowng mih hown akeng mih Israeluüa powt mih dow Jezrel lawngrawi kowi kowh uowi mih Israeluüa khita khai. Nami khita hanow amatni paw amatni kowh marow mih towla hüah hanow powt khai, now naiawngün marow maten dow Filistinuüa uang ta powngta bowk khai.<verse eid="1CH 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 10:8" />Now auai ni dow Filistinuüa mih kowng mih Israeluüa kowh uanh maten nauang paw kownkow uang tarü khai bowt. Nakhowk khe amatni dow Gilboa hungh luk kowi Sawl hai achapauüa kowh uak takuak hüah mih uang khi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 10:9" />Amatni dow Sawl kowh lu dungta pe khai, now aia kowh tawnguat hai tasen müa rutchün khawkleng klüpla now pawla khai. Now amatni kowh arup aren chupra kim maten kowi hai amatni kowh maru-uüa maten kowi nami satang nakrawi phowngla pe kownkow naiawngün mih Filistin pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 10:10" />Nami kung kowi dow amatni mih Sawl kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng pawla now amatni kowh thurai chup kim kowi towah büah khai, now aia kowh buk dow Dagawn thurai chup kim kowi tarta hüah khai.<verse eid="1CH 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 10:11" />Now Sawl luk kowi naiawng Filistinuüa changah mih satang dow Jabes-Gilead marow kowi kowh maru-uüa mih tawi ta khai bowt. <verse eid="1CH 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 10:12" />Naiawng rakowi nakowi kowh tasen akiakma mih siphaiuüa dow kowtarü büah hanow Sawl hai achapauüa uak mih Jabes marow kowi uang kawtla büah khai. Now amatni dow naiawngün hut mih nakowi kowh painglang singh tut re-e dupah büah khai. Now amatni uowila uiting uangtak mih natüngla büah kownkow ranit ni mowr khang hawm büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13-14" style="v" sid="1CH 10:13-14" />Naiawng mang Sawl kowng mih dow CHAKRAMANG kaah sakowm dowi iawng uowi rakowi chekhai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowh ana pek chün dowi, now aia dow CHAKRAMANG tut-e paw prengia dowi kowi lümla ngak hown taklawp taiua mih maru tut-e cham paw prengia khai. Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG mih aia kowi kowngta khai, now aia kowh mang chowm rah dow Jese kowh chapa David kowi apta pe khai.<verse eid="1CH 10:13-14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="1CH 11" />
  <para style="s">Israel pren kowi David chowm mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 11:1" />Akung kowi Israeluüa maten mih Hebrawn marow kowi David tut-e kowkowi khai. Now David kowi kowtek pe mih, “A-i dow pabuk panga chak maru chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 11:2" />Sawl chowm mang reng tak khe khowm padow cham dowk tasen rah kowi Israel siphaiuüa kowi en chowtaih kruitownla mih paw anging tuk. Now Israeluüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih hai Israeluüa luk kowi en nauowi aluchow kown mih paw CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai mih tek en chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 11:3" />Naiawng David tut-e Hebrawn marow kowi lawngtang aluchowuüa uang mih khin khe mang David dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi amatni hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai. Now Samuel hownia kowh CHAKRAMANG tekah mih laiklow iawng amatni dow Israel pren kowi nachowm mang kownkow David kowi nümnapah khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow David powngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 11:4" />Akung kowi mang David hai Israeluüa maten mih Jebusuüa uowi rah Jebus marow kowi kowkowi khai. (Jebus marow dow Jerusalem marow chekhai). <verse eid="1CH 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 11:5" />Nakhowk khe David kowi Jebusuüa tek pe mih, “Makowi en nauang ia kup kown nadowi,” pakhai. Nachenganchepaw David dow Jerusalem marow mih kowpowngta khai; aia dow Zaiawn kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim powngta pe khai. Naiawng rakowi akung kowi Zaiawn kowi dow David marow pahai maru chap pe ming khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 11:6" />Jebusuüa kowi kowsenah khe David tek mih, “Mia iawng mih maru chow Jebusuüa kowi kowrik sen mih dow siphai aluchowuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih nachowng kown,” pakhai. Nahanow Zerui kowh chapa Joab mih Jebusuüa kowi kowrik sen khai. Naiawng rakowi Joab kowi siphai aluchowuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih arah David peah khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 11:7" />Nami kung kowi dow David mih nami akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi kowuowi khai, now nami dow David marow pahai chap pe ming khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 11:8" />Aia dow nami marow satlawt prakowi thiaah mih arah hownia uown raw marow khai, now David krawi rawla dowi mih arah dow Joab mih krawi raw khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 11:9" />Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG dow aia tut-e tawi uowi reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi David dow uang lang kür ngamlam khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh akürma miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 11:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham iawng paprenma luk kowi David mih naia changla alow kownkow aia kowh akürma miuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kri miuüa dow Israeluüa maten hown tabawngah hanow David prakowi tawi tangi khai, now David kowh mang chowm rah mih akhawtma changah büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 11:11" />Naiawngün akürma mih maru-uüa pungmadawng kowi lowk ia mih dow Jasobeam chekhai. Jasobeam dow Hakmoni kowh chapa chekhai. Jasobeam dow Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Pakat tasen sang aia kowh reh hown aia mih maru iun 300 ia kowi saita khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 11:12" />Now alowk mih dow Eleazar chekhai. Aia dow Aho krungchak Dodo kowh chapa chekhai. Aia paw Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thumchakuüa pungmadawng kowi kowh lowk ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 11:13" />Aia dow Filistin siphaiuüa nauang piak iakmow khang kownkow Pas-Damim kowi takua talawm khe David tut-e tawi uowi khai. Nakhowk khe akeng mih Israel siphaiuüa dow iakmow khang re-e Filistinuüa pur hownia powt bowk khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 11:14" />Nachenganchepaw David hai Eleazar iüah dow nami iakmow khang dawnglang kowi iowngah hanow Filistinuüa kowi senah khai. Naiawng hai amatchi dow Filistin siphaiuüa kowi kowngta bowk khai. Nami ni khe CHAKRAMANG mih amatni kowi lawngah khai, now pe awngah khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 11:15" />Now akat khe dow <char style="w">Hiareng</char> 30 ia hownia sum ia mih Adulam puk re-e kowh huamang re-e David tut-e uang khai. Nakhowk khe Filistin siphaiuüa dow Refaim lawngrawi kowi khup tangbung büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 11:16" />Nami khin khe David dow süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi uowi khai, now Filistin siphaiuüa dow Bethlehem marow kowi uowi büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 11:17" />Nami khin khe David dow lainowmma tui sakkrai khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek pe mih, “Bethlehem marow tapplawt re-e kowh tuikuam hownia mia iawng mih chü kowpaw ang tui ditchow dit panü,” pakhai. <verse eid="1CH 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 11:18" />Naiawng rakowi tasen kiakma mih maru sum ia dow Filistin siphaiuüa kowi senla se Bethlehem marow tapplawt re-e kowh tuikuam kowi kowkowi khai, now nami tuikuam hownia towngla tui hanow David kowi uang pawla pe khai. Nachenganchepaw nami tui mih David khamah dowi chekhai. Nami tui dow CHAKRAMANG kowi ap-ah mih iawng hai aia khükta khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 11:19" />Aia tek mih, “Aw Thurai, mami tui mih mapaw ang nakham kown nadowi. Mami tui ang kham hanow mami tui kowtowng ang miuüa kowh vi ang kham mih hown tatu chekhai,” pakhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami tui kowtowng miuüa dow singsing kowngkowng amatni kowh sak uam pe kowh kowtowng tui mih chekhai. Nami aming anang uowima mih Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thumchakuüa kowh lup dow naiawng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 11:20" />Now aming anang uowima mih sum ia luk kowi kowh lang kri mih dow Joab kowh naumow Abisai chekhai. Aia dow aia kowh reh hown maru iun 300 ia kowi senah now saita bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi aia paw sum ia mih iawng aming anang uowima chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 11:21" />Aia dow Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi aming anang lang paw khai. Now aia dow nami thumchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi kowh maru nadowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 11:22" />Kabzel marow hownia kowh Jehoiada chapa Benaia dow tasen kiakma chekhai. Aia paw akraing akraingma mih lup chang khai. Aia dow Moab chenchap kowi kowh tasen kiakma mih siphai pre ia kowi kowngta khai. Akat khe paw nangkhe kla mih khin khe aia dow krangsi kuam kowi kowdowm hanow kowkowngta krangsi apum khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 11:23" />Nami klen kowi akro ranit muk ngia mih Aigupta maru kowi paw aia saita lowk ia khai. Nami Aigupta maru rut kowi dow pawngpai khowt mih reh uowi apung chekhai. Nachenganchepaw aia dow dowkla müa lowk now nami Aigupta maru prakowi kowtarü khai. Aia dow nami Aigupta maru rut kowi kowh reh rupta pe hanow nami reh hown aia kowi sawtah now kowngta khai. <verse eid="1CH 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 11:24" />Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia kowh lup dow naiawng chekhai. Aia paw Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thumchakuüa iawng aming anang uowima chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 11:25" />Aia kowi dow Sum pami tasen kiakma mih thum kowi klowkla dowi chepaw aia dow Süngkawm pami tasen kiakma mih thumchakuüa lak-e lang ka ringkawra chekhai. Benaia kowi dow aia kowh kangchawng miuüa kowi kowh aluchow David thawpah khai.<verse eid="1CH 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 11:26" />David kowh tasen kiakma mih maru-uüa dow Joab kowh naumow Asahel, Bethlehem hownia kowh Dodo chapa Elhanan, <verse eid="1CH 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 11:27" />Harawd hownia kowh Sama, Pelawn hownia kowh Helez, <verse eid="1CH 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 11:28" />Tekoa hownia kowh Ikes chapa Ira, Anathawt hownia kowh Abiezer, <verse eid="1CH 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 11:29" />Husa hownia kowh Sibekai, Aho hownia kowh Ilai, <verse eid="1CH 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 11:30" />Netofa hownia kowh Maharai, Nefofa hownia kowh Bana chapa Heled, <verse eid="1CH 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 11:31" />Benjamin süng kowi kowh Gibeah hownia Ribai chapa Ithai, Pirathawn hownia kowh Benaia, <verse eid="1CH 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 11:32" />Gas hungh re-e kowh lawngrawi hownia Hurai, Araba hownia kowh Abiel, <verse eid="1CH 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 11:33" />Baharum hownia kowh Azmavet, Salbawn hownia kowh Eliaba, <verse eid="1CH 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 11:34" />Gizawn hownia kowh Hasem chapauüa, Harar hownia kowh Sake chapa Jonathan, <verse eid="1CH 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 11:35" />Harar hownia kowh Sakhar chapa Ahiam, Ur kowh chapa Elifal, <verse eid="1CH 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 11:36" />Mekerat hownia kowh Hefer, Pelawn hownia kowh Ahija, <verse eid="1CH 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 11:37" />Karmel hownia kowh Hezro, Ezbai kowh chapa Narai, <verse eid="1CH 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 11:38" />Nathan kowh naumow Joel, Hakri kowh chapa Mibhar, <verse eid="1CH 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 11:39" />Amawn hownia kowh Zelek, Joab kowh tasen müa rutchün khawkleng dowk mih Berawt hownia kowh Naharai, <verse eid="1CH 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 11:40" />Jatir hownia kowh Ira hai Gareb, <verse eid="1CH 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 11:41" />Betseba kowh hua Hit chenchap Uria, Ahlai kowh chapa Zabad, <verse eid="1CH 11:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 11:42" />Siza kowh chapa Adina; aia dow Reuben krungchakuüa kowh aluchow chekhai, now aia hown dow siphai uowi 30 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 11:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 11:43" />Maka kowh chapa Hanan, Mitna hownia kowh Josafat, <verse eid="1CH 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="1CH 11:44" />Astarawt hownia kowh Uzia, Aroer hownia kowh Hotham chapa Sama hai Jeiel, <verse eid="1CH 11:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="1CH 11:45" />Simri kowh chapa Jediael hai Tiz hownia kowh anaumow Joha, <verse eid="1CH 11:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="1CH 11:46" />Mahava hownia kowh Eliel, Elnaam kowh chapa Jeribai hai Josavia, Moab hownia kowh Itma, <verse eid="1CH 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="1CH 11:47" />Eliel hai Obed, now Zoba hownia Jasiel büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 11:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="1CH 12" />
  <para style="s">David hown Benjamin krungchak siphaiuüa tawi tabawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 12:1" />David dow Kis chapa Sawl hownia cham powt hanow Ziklak marow kowi kowuowi khai. Nakowi aia uowi khe aia cham tasen khe kowh tawi khowngah reng mih tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa dow aia hown uang tabawng khai. <verse eid="1CH 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 12:2" />Naiawngün siphai hawmh dow Benjamin krungchak hownia kowh Sawl chuprek chaprekuüa chekhai. Amatni dow hawmlawm lakuai hown salangba ap akiakma kangowh, now uiah mih ba kuak paw akiakma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 12:3" />Amatni kowh siphai aluchow dow Gibeah marowchak Semas chapa Ahiezer chekhai, now Ahiezer dak kowi dow Joas chekhai. Now siphaiuüa dow Azmaet kowh chapa Jeziel hai Pelet, Beraka, Anathawt marowchak Jehu; <verse eid="1CH 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 12:4" />Gibeawn marowchak Ismaia, aia dow <char style="w">Hiareng</char> 30 ia kowi kowh aluchow; Gedera marowchak Jeremia, Jahaziel, Johanan, Jozabad; <verse eid="1CH 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 12:5" />Haruf marowchak Eluzai, Jerimawt, Bealia, Semaria, Sefatia; <verse eid="1CH 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 12:6" />Kora krungchak Elkana, Isia, Azarel, Joezer, Jasobeam, <verse eid="1CH 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 12:7" />now Gedawr marowchak Jeroham kowh chapa Joela hai Zebadia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">David hown Gad krungchak siphaiuüa tawi tabawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 12:8" />Süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi David uowi khe Gad krungchakuüa tasen kiakma miuüa amatni thum hownia lang taprai now David hown uang tabawng ne khai. Amatni dow kawngma hai reh hown tasen kiakma kangowh chekhai. Amatni dow krangsi iawng akürma, now hungh kowi kowh naki iawng iowm lenma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:8" /><verse number="9-13" style="v" sid="1CH 12:9-13" />Amatni lailowk ia kowi kowh aluchow dow Ezer chekhai. Now siphaiuüa dow Obadia, Eliab, Mismana, Jeremia, Atai, Eliel, Johanan, Elzabad, alowk mih Jeremia hai Makbanai büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:9-13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 12:14" />Amatni dow siphai aluchow kangowh chekhai. Amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen lang kiak dowi nowm nowm mih khowm padow maru iun 100 ia kowi nowng chekhai, now amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh tasen lang kiak nowm nowm mih dow maru iun 1,000 ia nowng mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 12:15" />Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow nami ning kowi kowh la uown khe pown Jawrdan aw büah khai. Nami la kowi dow aw kowi mih tui atekma chekhai. Amatni dow haipown Jawrdan aw hanow satlawt pra lawngrawi hai satkup pra lawngrawi kowi kowh uowi miuüa kowi kowprütta khai.<verse eid="1CH 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">David hown pre krungchak siphaiuüa tawi tabawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 12:16" />Benjamin krungchak hai Juda krungchak hownia kowh akeng mih siphaiuüa dow David kowh akhawtma mih kangchawngra kim kowi uang khai. <verse eid="1CH 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 12:17" />Nakhowk khe David dow amatni hown kowtakrum hanow tek pe mih, “Nauang khowng kownkow saktuak iungma hown enni uang mih chekhai hanow auiua asinma ang natuak enni kown. Tawkche tawngpaw ang chang enni angak dowi kowi ransu-uüa rut kowi naap ang kownkow enni uang kuan ang mih chekhai kowh chalow hanow Thurai tuk, now aia narip enni kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 12:18" />Nakhowk khe Hiareng 30 ia kowi kowh aluchow Amasai luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh lümla uang towm khai. Aia tek mih,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">“Aw David, anging dow en kowh towbowt;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Jese chapa, en hown anging tawi tabawng kown nau.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 12:18">En hai khowng en miuüa dow pacham awng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 12:18">Tawngplawng kowchow panow en kowh Thurai chowtaih khowng en tasen khai,” pape khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 12:18">Nahanow David dow naiawngün siphaiuüa kowi bawngla khai. Now amatni kowi dow aia kowh siphaiuüa luk kowi thawpah aluchow khai.<verse eid="1CH 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">David hown Manase krungchak siphaiuüa tawi tabawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 12:19" />Sawl kowi kowsen kownkow Filistinuüa hown David tarü mih khin khe Israel siphai thum hownia powt hanow Manase krungchak mih David tut-e kowtawi tabawng ne khai. Tawkche David hai aia maru-uüa dow Filistinuüa kowi tawi khowngah dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow David nakuanah kown mih ka tuak rakowi Filistin kruitown miuüa mih David kowi pe mangta khai. Amatni tatek mih, “David napowtta a-i hanow a-pu Sawl hown natawi tabawng kown chekhai, now nakowngta a-i bowk kown chekhai,” pabüah khai. <verse eid="1CH 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 12:20" />Now Ziklak marow prakowi David plan mih khin khe Manase krungchak hownia kowh David tut-e tawi tabawng miuüa dow Adnak, Jozabad, Jediael, Mikael, Jozabad, Elihu hai Zilethai büah chekhai. Amatni dow Manase krungchak kowi kowh siphai 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 12:21" />Naiawngün siphaiuüa dow akeng mih ransu-uüa hown David cham tasen mih khin khe tawi khowngah khai. Amatni dow tasen kiakma kangowh chekhai. Akung kowi amatni dow siphai aluchow mih rah ka büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 12:22" />Naiawng hai maru kawmuüa mih David kowi nauang khowngah kownkow pani kowh pani David hown uang tabawng ngamlam khai. Nahanow David kowh siphai hawmh kawm krang dow Thurai kowh siphai hawmh iawng uang phaw khai bowt.<verse eid="1CH 12:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">David hown akeng mih siphaiuüa tawi tabawng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 12:23" />Maiawngün dow Hebrawn marow kowi David hown uang tawi tabawng mih maru iun mut chekhai. Amatni uang mih dow CHAKRAMANG laiklow iawng Sawl takcha Israel pren kowi David nachowm mang kown mih kowi uang tawi khowngah kownkow chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 12:24" />Juda krungchak hownia kawngma hai reh hown tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa uang mih dow 6,800 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 12:25" />Simiawn krungchak hownia tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa uang mih dow 7,000 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 12:26" />Levi krungchak hownia uang mih dow 4,600 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 12:27" />Naiawngün pungmadawng kowi dow Arawn krungchak kowi kowh aluchow Jehoiada hai aia dak kowi kowh uowi mih siphai 3,700 ia paw tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 12:28" />Now sakkraingma mih klanguüa tasen kiakma mih Zadawk hai aia krungchak kowi kowh maru iuk 22 ia paw tawi uowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 12:29" />Sawl hown pakrungchak mih Benjamin krungchak hownia uang mih dow 3,000 ia. Tawkche David tut-e uang tabawng dowi rawn dow Benjamin krungchakuüa mih Sawl kimchakuüa prakowi lang tangi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 12:30" />Efraim krungchak hownia chowlowkkow chen kowi kowh tasen kürma mih siphaiuüa uang mih dow 20,800 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 12:31" />Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh Manase krungchak dawnglang hownia uang mih dow 18,000 ia chekhai. Naiawngün maru-uüa dow David kowi nape chowngah mang kownkow nauang khowngah kown mih amatni kowh aluchowuüa ruiah mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 12:32" />Isakar krungchak hownia aluchowuüa uang mih dow 200 ia. Amatni dow prengia uowima kangowh, now tawng mih khin kowi tawng chow Israeluüa achang takla mih tuk büah reng chekhai. Amatni hown dow amatni kowh tasin taken miuüa paw uang tawi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 12:33" />Zebulun krungchak hownia tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa uang mih dow 50,000 ia. Amatni dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng chap maiow hown cham tasen reng chekhai. Amatni mih kaah sakowmma hown David kowi kaneuma tawi khowngah kownkow uang mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 12:34" />Naptali krungchak hownia siphai aluchowuüa uang mih dow 1,000 ia. Amatni tut-e dow kawngma hai reh hown tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa paw uang tawi 37,000 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 12:35" />Dan krungchak hownia tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa uang mih dow 28,600 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 12:36" />Aser krungchak hownia tasen kiakma mih siphaiuüa uang mih dow 40,000 ia. <verse eid="1CH 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 12:37" />Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh Reuben krungchak, Gad krungchak hai Manase krungchak dawnglang hownia uang mih dow 120,000 ia. Amatni dow tasen müa rutchün khawkleng chap maten uang pawla khai.<verse eid="1CH 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 12:38" />Hebrawn marow kowi naiawngün maru kawmuüa uang mih dow amatni kowh nau rah pachapchow mih rakowi chekhai. Nami dow amatni Israeluüa luk kowi David kowi nape chowmah mang kown mih chekhai. Now akeng mih Israeluüa maten paw David kowi nape chowmah mang kown mih nauta bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 12:39" />Naiawngün maru kawmuüa dow nakowi sum ni mowr David hown taiua cha taiua kham khai. Amatni kowi hawt peah chakkham mih dow nakowi kowh uowi mih amatni kowh tainau-uüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 12:40" />Nami klen kowi alakma kowi kowh uowi mih Isakar krungchakuüa, Zebulun krungchakuüa hai Naptali krungchakuüa paw kawrngaramchük, ut, kawrnga hai chiala luk kowi tangla now maru kawmuüa nacha nakhamah kown mih uang pawla chakkham khai. Amatni dow kawmdi ün, uidut uih ün, grep keu ün, grep tui ün hai kanrawn sau ün ahuma uang pawla khai. Now nangenah kown mih vüi paw chia, rua hai ruapur paw uang pawla büah khai. Naiawng hai Israel paprenma kowi kowh maru-uüa dow lainowmma piaw büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 12:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="1CH 13" />
  <para style="s">Israeluüa cham paw sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 13:1" />David mih siphai aluchowuüa maten hown tapaw prengia khai. Naiawngün aluchowuüa dow siphai 100 ia kowi kowh aluchow, now tawngbak mih dow siphai 1,000 ia kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 13:2" />Nami kung kowi dow Israeluüa maten kowi aia tek pe mih, “Enni tuak kowi che iung hai CHAKRAMANG naukrang chekhai hanow chu, Israel pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi a-i krawi phowng satang diah sik. A-i kowh tainau-uüa maten hai amatni tut-e kowh uowi mih uamowuüa hai Leviuüa maten a-i hown nauang tabawng kownkow a-i krawi chia diah sik. <verse eid="1CH 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 13:3" />Now a-i kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih a-i tut-e a-i uang pawla diah sik. Sawl chowm mang mih khin khe dow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla lawnguan kowi a-i pe ching dowi chekhai,” pakhai. <verse eid="1CH 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 13:4" />Naiawng nachang kown takla pami ka tuak büah bowk khai. Naiawng rakowi naiawng nachang kown mih Israeluüa maten nauta khai.<verse eid="1CH 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 13:5" />Naiawng rakowi Kiriat-Jearim marow hownia Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nauang pawla kownkow David mih Aigupta pren kowi kowh Sihawr aw hownia Lebo-Hamat marow mowr kowi kowh Israeluüa uowi mih maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="1CH 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 13:6" />Now David hai Israeluüa maten dow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nakowpaw kownkow Juda pren kowi kowh Kiriat-Jearim marow kowi kowkowi khai bowt. (Kiriat-Jearim marow kowi dow Bala marow pah paw tek pe khai). Israeluüa dow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla küm luk kowi kowh <char style="w">Cherup</char> rup takra kowi CHAKRAMANG uowi pahai owmah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 13:7" />Amatni dow Abinadab kim hownia Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uang lawtla hanow chia kari sar kowi uang towah khai. Nakhowk khe kowh nami chia kari te mih dow Uza hai Ahiaw iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 13:8" />Nakhowk khe David hai Israeluüa maten dow Thurai pur kowi kür uowi srui plai se plai se tek meng khai, now prui, tingteng, taraw, sawkchow, towmmow chah hai baw ün tumla büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 13:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 13:9" />Nachenganchepaw Kidawn kowh cha thuara re-e uang ting büah khe küngla kari mih chiala pre pum trui mih tatheu khai. Nakhowk khe Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nadowh pakowh Uza mih haidowkta khai. <verse eid="1CH 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 13:10" />Naiawng sangbowk laitawm tawkpla awr dowkta khai rakowi CHAKRAMANG dow Uza kowi lainowmma kunmarauah khai. Naiawng rakowi aia kowi dow CHAKRAMANG pawta pe asak khai. Nahanow Uza dow Thurai pur kowi hing kowng khai.<verse eid="1CH 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 13:11" />Naiawng Uza kowi CHAKRAMANG pawta pe asak khai rakowi David dow kunmarau khai. Naiawng rakowi nami arah ming dow Perez-Uza pahai aia chap pe khai. (Perez-Uza pami dow “Uza kowh piakra” pami chekhai). Nami arah ming dow kawmat paw Perez-Uza chowreng tak chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 13:12" />Nami ni khe David mih Thurai kowi lainowmma kramah khai. Aia tek mih, “Tawng iawng chow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla ang tut-e ang uang ia pawla kown chow?” pakhai. <verse eid="1CH 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 13:13" />Naiawng rakowi sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih David marow kowi aia tut-e pawla dowi bowt chekhai. Aia dow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Gat marowchak Obed-Edawm pami kowh kim kowi towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 13:14" />Nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow sum la mowr Obed-Edawm kim kowi uowi khai. Nakhowk khe Obed-Edawm kimchakuüa kowi hai aia kowh uowi mih maten luk kowi CHAKRAMANG peah prasi khai.<verse eid="1CH 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="1CH 14" />
  <para style="s">David kowh masi chauüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 14:1" />Nami kung kowi dow Sur pren mang mih David tut-e kowchin maru sangrum khai. Now naiawngün maru-uüa kung kowi David kowh kim chang müa vüi sidar singh, kim chang sarauüa hai hua hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa kowi aia krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 14:2" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG mih Israeluüa luk kowi aia kowh mangra pe nikah mih chowbowt pami hai Israeluüa iung müa kowi aia kowh pren lainowmma pe iuksownah mih chowbowt pami David tuk khai bowt.<verse eid="1CH 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 14:3" />Jerusalem marow kowi uowi khe David dow plan paw masi ne tak chekhai, now chapa hai chama paw plan ka küng tak chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 14:4" />Jerusalem marow kowi uowi khe kowh David kaah mih chauüa dow Samua, Sobab, Nathan, Sawlawmawn, <verse eid="1CH 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 14:5" />Ibhar, Elisua, Elpelet, <verse eid="1CH 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 14:6" />Noga, Nefek, Jafia, <verse eid="1CH 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 14:7" />Elisama, Beliada hai Elifelet büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi David nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 14:8" />Now Israeluüa maten luk kowi nape chowmah mang kownkow David kowi nümnapah mih satang tata hanow Filistinuüa dow siphai maten hown nauang senah kownkow uang tarü khai. Nami tata hanow David paw Filistinuüa kowi nauang senah kownkow uang lawt khai. <verse eid="1CH 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 14:9" />Nami khin khe Filistin siphaiuüa dow Refaim lawngrawi kowi uang khup tangbung khai, now nami hownia aria aret kowi kowh kua kowi krawi tarowng dowk tasen hanow krawi paw uanh büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 14:10" />Nakhowk khe Thurai kowi David lüntaah mih, “Filistinuüa kowi ang kowsenah kown bow? Amatni kowi ang rut kowi en naap ang kown bow?” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 14:10">Nakhowk khe Thurai klangah mih, “Kowsen bowt. Amatni kowi en rut kowi ang naapta en kown,” pape khai.<verse eid="1CH 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 14:11" />Nahanow David dow aia kowh siphaiuüa hown Filistin siphaiuüa kowi kowsenah hanow nowngta khai. Naiawng rakowi aia tek mih, “Thurai dow tui owng takhue khe kowh iawng ang kowh ransu-uüa kowi ang rut hown piakah khai,” pakhai. Now nami re-e kowh arah ming dow Baal-Perazim pahai chap pe khai. (Baal-Perazim pami auan dow “Thurai piakah mih” pami chekhai). <verse eid="1CH 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 14:12" />Filistin siphaiuüa dow powt khe nami tasenra re-e amatni kowh thuraiuüa rup ta lawtla khai. Naiawngün arup dow David kowh ana pek hown siphaiuüa mih tikta bowk khai.<verse eid="1CH 14:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 14:13" />Nami kung kowi paw Filistinuüa dow nami lawngrawi kowi uang dowk tasen khai iawk. <verse eid="1CH 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 14:14" />Nakhowk khe paw David dow Thurai tut-e rik lüntaah khai. Nakhowk khe dow Thurai klangah mih, “Khaleng dow amatni purdowng hownia hangkow kowi büah tham; amatni kung hownia phai kowkowi büa diah. Now ‘Balsam’ singh rüm re-e umta lut hanow senah büa diah. <verse eid="1CH 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 14:15" />Painglang singh plawng kowi dow siphai mang tün iawng en nata kown. Naiawng en ta hown krowksang amatni kowi en nasenah kown. Tawngplawng kowchow panow Filistin siphai hawmh kowi nasenah kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow en pur kowi rik mang mih chowbowt,” pape khai. <verse eid="1CH 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 14:16" />Nahanow David dow Thurai ana pek iawng rowprowp chang khai. Nami khin khe amatni dow Gibeawn hownia Gezer marow mowr patiama rawng Filistin siphaiuüa kowi saiah khai.<verse eid="1CH 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 14:17" />Naiawng hai David kowh aming anang dow arah maten kowi krawi tauet khai, now David kowi nakram kown mih saktuak pren maten kowi CHAKRAMANG uang pawla khai.<verse eid="1CH 14:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="1CH 15" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 15:1" />David dow aia vüi Jerusalem marow kowi krawi thawp kim sangrum khai. Nami kung kowi dow Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towk müa kamrüt pe arah lowk khai. Now nami arah kowi dow aia khup pe tangbung khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 15:2" />Nami kung kowi David tek mih, “Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow Leviuüa klen kowi miapaw naia kawt kown nadowi. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nakawt kownkow hai chowngchowng saksakma CHAKRAMANG kowh lup nachang kownkow Leviuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG lang klota khowk chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 15:3" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla vüi aia kamrütta mih arah re-e nauang pawla sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kownkow Israeluüa maten kowi arasang David kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 15:4" />Aia kuaah lawmah mih Arawn krungchak hai Leviuüa dow <verse eid="1CH 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 15:5" />Kohat krungchakuüa hownia 120 ia; amatni kowh aluchow dow Uriel chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 15:6" />Merari krungchakuüa hownia 220 ia; amatni kowh aluchow dow Asaia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 15:7" />Gersawn krungchakuüa hownia 130 ia; amatni kowh aluchow dow Joel chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 15:8" />Elizafan krungchakuüa hownia 200 ia; amatni kowh aluchow dow Semaia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 15:9" />Hebrawn krungchakuüa hownia 80 ia; amatni kowh aluchow dow Eliel chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 15:10" />Uziel krungchakuüa hownia 112 ia; amatni kowh aluchow dow Aminadab chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 15:11" />Nami kung kowi dow mang David mih uamow Zadawk hai Abiathar iüah hailawm Levi chenchap Uriel, Asaia, Joel, Semaia, Eliel hai Aminadab büah tut-e kowchin maru hanow amatni kowi uang hawla khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 15:12" />Now naiawngün maru-uüa kowi mang David tek pe mih, “Enni dow Levi krungchak chowlowkkow machak kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. Enni hai enni tainau Leviuüa mih CHAKRAMANG vüi tachim tasai büa diah. Nahanow ang kamrütta mih arah kowi dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih enni nauang ia pawla kown. <verse eid="1CH 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 15:13" />Auown khe nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla enni uang pawla dowi rakowi CHAKRAMANG a-i kowh Thurai dow a-i luk kowi lainowmma kunmarau khai. Now aia kowh ana pek iawng tawng iawng chow nami sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nauang pawla kown mih paw aia kowi a-i lüntaah dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 15:14" />Naiawng rakowi uamowuüa hai Leviuüa dow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nauang ia pawla kownkow CHAKRAMANG vüi kowmatia kowi tachim tasai büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 15:15" />Now Leviuüa dow Mosi kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana iawng Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih akawtlawng hown kawtla büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 15:16" />Now Leviuüa kowh aluchowuüa kowi amatni kowh tainau-uüa pungmadawng hownia tingteng, taraw hai klingchow tepla se natekla awmrawm meng kownkow meng sarauüa kowi naruiah kown mih David tek pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 15:17" />Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa dow Joel kowh chapa Heman, Berekia kowh chapa Asaf hai Kusaia kowh chapa Ethan kowi ruiah büah khai. Asaf dow Heman krungchakuüa hownia kowh chekhai, now Ethan dow Merari krungchakuüa kowh hownia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 15:18" />Naiawngün meng sarauüa kowh akhowng miuüa dow Zekaria, Jaziel, Semiramawt, Jehiel, Uni, Eliab, Benaia, Maseia, Matithia, Elifelehu, Mikneia büah hai kimplawt chawng mih Obed-Edawm hai Jeiel iüah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 15:19" />Now kri hown kowh klingchow tep miuüa dow meng sara Heman, Asaf hai Ethan büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 15:20" />Tingteng tep miuüa dow Zekaria, Aziel, Semiramawt, Jehiel, Uni, Eliab, Maseia hai Benaia büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 15:21" />Taraw tep miuüa dow Matithia, Elifelehu, Mikneia, Obed-Edawm, Jeiel hai Azazia büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 15:22" />Meng krui mih dow Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchow Kenania chekhai. Aia dow meng tukma rakowi aia luk kowi nami kurdik peah khai.<verse eid="1CH 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23-24" style="v" sid="1CH 15:23-24" />Now sangbowk laitawm tawkpla chawng miuüa dow Berekia, Elkana, Obed-Edawm hai Jehia büah chekhai. Now Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi narik tum baw kown miuüa dow uamow Sebania, Josafat, Nethanel, Amasai, Zekaria, Benaia hai Eliezer büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 15:23-24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 15:25" />Nami kung kowi dow mang David, Israel lawngtang aluchowuüa hai athawng aiawng siphai aluchowuüa mih Obed-Edawm kim hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla nauang pawla kownkow apiaw apama hown tarü büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 15:26" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih Leviuüa kowi dow Thurai tawi khowngah reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi amatni dow chiala ranit pum hai ruapur ranit pum Thurai vüi phuchuaah büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 15:27" />Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla kawt mih Leviuüa, meng sarauüa hai meng tek mih thum kowi kowh meng krui mih Kenania büah dow adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat khupma kangowh chekhai. Now mang David paw adipükchow mih la hown kowh tawnguat hai adipükchow mih la hown kowh ephawd kowrmow khupma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 15:28" />Maiawng hai Israeluüa maten dow tumla nang hai baw se, tepla klingchow, tingteng, taraw hai howla sawmlawm se CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 15:29" />Jerusalem marow kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uang kupla mih khin khe Sawl kowh chama Mika dow tawngpawk hownia David kowi hawt tang müah krowrow khai. Now aia dow naiawng mang David plai mih hai awmrawm mih khita hanow sakdawng kowi David kowi suiah khai.<verse eid="1CH 15:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="1CH 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 16:1" />Maru kawmuüa dow David thawpah mih Thurai kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towk müa tangbung lak kowi sangbowk laitawm tawkpla mih uang towah khai. Nami kung kowi dow Thurai vüi tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap chang büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 16:2" />Naiawngün uanap pawi ki chang kung kowi dow CHAKRAMANG ming hown maru kawmuüa kowi David peah prasi khai. <verse eid="1CH 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 16:3" />Now Israel chenchap masiuüa hai kachakuüa maten kowi dow kawm apah, chaknga asek hai grep uih keu kawm apah chi aia peah khai.<verse eid="1CH 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 16:4" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi uang chupiia Thurai miuüa kowi nakruitown kownkow David mih Levi chenchap hownia tow maru sangrum khai. Naiawngün maru-uüa kowh lup dow naawr chup Thurai kown mih, awr tek awmrawm lai kown mih hai CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kowi nakiow kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 16:5" />Nami thumchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Asaf chekhai, now akhowng mih dow Zekaria chekhai. Asaf kowh thumchakuüa dow Jeiel, Semiramawt, Jehiel, Matithia, Eliab, Benaia, Obed-Edawm hai Jeiel büah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow tingteng hai taraw tep mih, Asaf dow klingchow tep mih, <verse eid="1CH 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 16:6" />now uamow Benaia hai Jahaziel iüah dow Thurai sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi akhin towng tum baw reng mih chekhai <verse eid="1CH 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 16:7" />Nami ni khe dow mami Thurai kowi tekla awmrawm lai mih meng Asaf hai aia thumchakuüa kowi David pe tekah khai.<verse eid="1CH 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai kowi David tek pe awmrawm lai mih meng</para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 16:8" />CHAKRAMANG tut-e tek awmrawm lai büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:8">aia kri kraing mih lawnguan phuang büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:8">now aia changah mih lup maten chen towng chap towng tut-e phuang büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 16:9" />Aia vüi kowi tek meng diah, aia kiow meng tek büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:9">aia changah mih awdara lup lawnguan maten krawi phuang büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 16:10" />Aia ming chimsaima mih kowi kiow büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:10">CHAKRAMANG kowi cham miuüa dow pacham piaw lah!<verse eid="1CH 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 16:11" />CHAKRAMANG kowi owmsak büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:11">aia kowh kür kowi owmsak büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:11">now atungma aia kowi cham büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12-13" style="v" sid="1CH 16:12-13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG kowh nar Jakawb krungchakuüa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12-13">aw Thurai kloah mih Israel krungchakuüa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:12-13">aia changah mih awdara lup tuakah reng büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:12-13">aia kowh tara laiklow sak kowi towah reng büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:12-13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 16:14" />CHAKRAMANG dow a-i kowh Thurai chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:14">aia kowh ana pek dow chen towng chap towng vüi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 16:15" />Thurai kowh ana pek dow chowngchowng saksakma sak kowi towah diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:15">aia kowh sangbowk laitawm mih katpaw hangkow tamata diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 16:16" />Nami sangbowk laitawm dow Abraham hown kowh aia tatowah mih chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:16">Isak tut-e kowh aia khamah mih sangbowk laitawm paw nami chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 16:17" />CHAKRAMANG dow Jakawb hown tatow sangbowk laitawm khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:17">nami sangbowk laitawm dow Israeluüa tut-e chowngchowng saksakma vüi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 16:18" />Aia tek mih, “Ang nape en Kanan pren kown.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:18">Nami dow en kowh dawngthawnguan naown kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 16:19" />Nami khin khe a-i kowh pipu-uüa dow maru iun a-echow chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:19">Nakhowk khe amatni dow Kanan pren kowi prenlang maru chowreng tak.<verse eid="1CH 16:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 16:20" />Amatni dow pachen süng hownia akeng mih chen süng kowi cham lenla pang khai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:20">papren hownia akeng mih pren kowi cham mangla pang khai.<verse eid="1CH 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 16:21" />Nachenganchepaw amatni luk kowi dow mia iawng mih kowi paw aia pe changah nowng dowi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:21">amatni kowi nalawngah kownkow manguüa kowi Thurai hangah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 16:22" />Aia tek pe mih, “Ang lang kloah mih maru-uüa kowi enni naia kak kown nadowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:22">ang kowh risiuüa kowi paw enni naia piak kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 16:23" />Aw palusama maru, CHAKRAMANG vüi tek meng diah!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:23">Aia lawng a-i mih laiklow ni towng ni towng phuang büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 16:24" />Aia kowh kraingra dow chen towng chap towng tut-e phuang büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:24">aia changah mih awdara lup lawnguan maru maten tut-e tek büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 16:25" />CHAKRAMANG dow kri kraingma, aia dow ahuma kiowri kak taing chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:25">aia dow akeng mih thuraiuüa lak-e paw kramra lang uowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 16:26" />Akeng chenchapuüa kowh thuraiuüa dow arup krowngchow taih.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:26">Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG dow mukuang thawp miia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 16:27" />CHAKRAMANG kowi ringkaw hai rowsi büa diah;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:27">aia uowi rah kowi dow kürra hai piawra atekma chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 16:28" />Aw chen towng chap towng maru-uüa, CHAKRAMANG kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:28">aia kowh kiowrira hai kür kowi kiow büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 16:29" />Aia ming kri kraingma mih kowi kiow büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:29">uanap hown aia pur kowi uang büa diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:29">CHAKRAMANG dow chimsaima rakowi chupiia büa diah.<verse eid="1CH 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 16:30" />Aw palusama maru maten,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:30">aia pur kowi chür büa diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:30">nowng chüah dowi pat lusa mih khikhawtma aia thawpah khai.<verse eid="1CH 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 16:31" />Mukuang hai lusa dow pacham piaw lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:31">CHAKRAMANG dow mang chekhai pami chenchapuüa tut-e pacham phuang büah lah.<verse eid="1CH 16:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 16:32" />Sata hai sata kowi kowh uowi mih maten dow aia kowi pacham kiow lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:32">dowm hai dowm kowi kowh luprak maten dow pacham piaw lah.<verse eid="1CH 16:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 16:33" />Kaurawng kowi kowh singh kau maten awmrawmma hown pacham tek meng lah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:33">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow lusa kowi nauang chet tara kownkow uang khowk.<verse eid="1CH 16:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 16:34" />CHAKRAMANG kowi tek pe awmrawm lai diah.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:34">Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia dow aiungma chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:34">Aia kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="1CH 16:35" />Maiawng tek büa diah, “Aw anging kowh lawng miia Thurai, uang lawng anging diah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">arasang kua anging hanow akeng chenchap hownia lawng anging diah.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 16:35">Nahanow en ming chimsaima mih vüi anging natek awmrawm lai kown,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:35">now apiawma hown anging naia tek en rowsi meng kown.<verse eid="1CH 16:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="1CH 16:36" />CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow akiow pauowi lah,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 16:36">aia dow achük alai hownia chowngchowng saksakma akiow pauowi reng lah,” pakhai.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 16:36" />
  <para style="m" vid="1CH 16:36">Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa tek mih, “Amen,” pakhai. Now maru-uüa mih Thurai kowi kiowah khai.<verse eid="1CH 16:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">David khowm bowk pe lup mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="1CH 16:37" />CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla pur kowi lakke takla mih lup ni towng nachang kownkow Asaf hai aia thumchakuüa kowi David towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 16:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="1CH 16:38" />Naiawngün maru-uüa kowi natawi khowngah kownkow Obed-Edawm hai aia thumchak 68 ia kowi paw David tow pe khai. Hosa hai Jeduthun kowh chapa Obed-Edawm iüah dow kangchawng mih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="1CH 16:39" />Gibeawn marow kowi kowh chupiiara kowi CHAKRAMANG kowh taklowp taklangra te pur kowi nachang lup kownkow uamow Zadawk hai aia hown kowh uamowuüa kowi David towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="1CH 16:40" />Nahanow amatni dow Israeluüa kowi kowh Mosi peah mih ana iawng rau towng iak towng nami phuchuara kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 16:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="1CH 16:41" />Nami klen kowi Heman, Jeduthun hai ruiah mih akeng miuüa kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura rakowi natek rowsi meng kownkow David towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 16:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="1CH 16:42" />Thurai rowsi meng tek mih khin khe kowh baw tum mih, klingchow tep mih hai akeng mih tünteu chang mih dow Heman hai Jeduthun iüah chekhai. Now kangchawng mih dow Jeduthun kowh chapauüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 16:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="1CH 16:43" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawm maten mih chowlowkkow kim prakowi mang khai, now David paw aia kimchakuüa kowi kowpe prasi kownkow aia kim kowi uang mang khai.<verse eid="1CH 16:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="1CH 17" />
  <para style="s">Mang David tut-e CHAKRAMANG kowh laikham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 17:1" />Aiamat kowh kim kowi aia uowi khe akat dow risi Nathan kowi David tek pe mih, “Kawmat ang dow sidar singh hown kowh thawpah mih kim kowi ang uowi khai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla uowi mih dow tangbung kowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 17:2" />Nakhowk khe risi Nathan klangah mih, “En sak kowi uowi iawng chang diah; Thurai tawi uowila en reng chekhai,” pape khai.<verse eid="1CH 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 17:3" />Nachenganchepaw nami iak dow CHAKRAMANG uang tek pe Nathan mih, <verse eid="1CH 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 17:4" />“Ang kowh nar David tut-e kowkowiah now en natek pe kown mih, ‘Ang kowh uowi rah en nathawp kown nadowi. <verse eid="1CH 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 17:5" />Aigupta pren hownia Israeluüa kowi ang uang lawtla mih ni hownia ani mowr tawng iawng mih kim kowi paw ang uowi dowi chekhai. Akeng kowi ang cham süt mih khin khe paw ang uowi mih dow tangbung kowi hai taklowp taklangra te kowi chowtaih. <verse eid="1CH 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 17:6" />Ang kowh maru Israeluüa cham kowi rah towng kowi amatni hown ang tawi uowi reng chekhai. Nachenganchepaw Israeluüa kowi naming nakhetah kownkow ang peah kurdik mih tara chet miuüa kowi dow, “Tawngplawng kowchow sidar singh hown ang uowi rah kim enni thawp ang dowi?” pami katpaw ang tek pe dowi chekhai,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 17:7" />Nami klen kowi risi Nathan kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Kawmat mih ang kowh nar David tut-e kowkowiah now tek pe kown mih, ‘En kowi dow dowm kowi kowh ruapur thing rah hownia ang uang pawla en khai, now ang kowh maru Israeluüa luk kowi kruitown miia ang thawp en khai. <verse eid="1CH 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 17:8" />En cham kowiah mih arah maten kowi paw ang tawi uowila en reng chekhai, now en kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi dow en pur hownia ang piakta en khai. En kowi dow lusa kowi kowh ming nang iukma mih maru iawng kri kraingma ang nachang en kown. <verse eid="1CH 17:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1CH 17:9-10" />Ang kowh maru Israeluüa vüi dow ang tow pe kruitown mih khowk chowdiah. Tawkche nami khin khe dow maru ngakuüa mih amatni kowi changah anowng apowng khai. Nachenganchepaw kawmat dow amatni luk kowi naiawng naphaw kown nadowi bowt. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang kowh maru Israeluüa vüi dow ang lang khowmta pe uowi rah parah khowk chekhai. Nakowi dow athaulangma amatni naia uowi bowt kown, now amatni kowi miapaw naia changah anowng apowng kown nadowi bowt. Now amatni kowh ransu-uüa maten kowi dow ang nape sumah bowt kown. <verse eid="1CH 17:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 17:11" />En kowng kowh en kowh pipu-uüa tadupra kowi dup en mih khin khe en krungchak hownia en matia chapa kowi ang nape chowmah mang kown, now aia kowh mangra dow anikma ang natow pe kown. <verse eid="1CH 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 17:12" />Nami en kowh chapa mih ang vüi nathawp ang kim kown, now aia kowh mangra dow chowngchowng saksakma anikma ang nachang pe kown. <verse eid="1CH 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 17:13" />Ang dow aia kowh pa nachowng kown, now aia dow ang kowh chapa nachowng kown. Now en dowi rawn kowh chowm mang mih kowi iawng ang kowh achur uowi dowi mih sakraura aia luk hownia dow mapaw ang napawta pe kown nadowi. <verse eid="1CH 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 17:14" />Ang kowh kim kowi hai ang kowh pren kowi chowngchowng saksakma anikma aia kowi dow ang natowah kown, now aia kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma nauowi reng kown,’ pape diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 17:15" />Now <char style="w">mukmang</char> kowi kowh nami laiklow maten dow risi Nathan mih David kowi tek pe bowk khai.<verse eid="1CH 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kowi David tek pe awmrawm lai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 17:16" />Naiawngün laiklow tata now mang David mih takrumra te lak kowi kowkup khai. Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chowm se tek mih, “Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang hai ang kimchakuüa dow tawngpaw asung uowi dowi mih maru chowtaih. Nachenganchepaw ang vüi kowi ahuma en chang ang khai. <verse eid="1CH 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 17:17" />Aw Thurai, anging vüi naiawng khowt en chang anging khowk chepaw en nachang anging küng kown mih en nau khai. En dow pur prakowi kowh ang kowh krungchakuüa vüi paw en khamla lai khai. Aw CHAKRAMANG Thurai, kri kraingma mih maru iawng en mü ang khai.<verse eid="1CH 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 17:18" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, tawng tak chow ang natek en kown! En kowh nar kowi dow en tuk mih towbowt. Nachenganchepaw en pe ang ringkawra khai. <verse eid="1CH 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 17:19" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh nar vüi en nau iawng kri kraingma mih lup en chang pe khai, now en kowh nar kowi en pe tukah khai.<verse eid="1CH 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 17:20" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, en iawng mih miapaw uowi dowi chekhai, now en klen kowi tawng iawng mih Thurai paw uowi dowi bowt pami anging matia param hown anging ta chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 17:21" />Nami klen kowi en kowh maru Israel chenchap iawng mih dow lusa kowi mia iawng mih chenchap paw lang uowi dowi bowt. Amatni kowi dow en kowh maru en nachangla kownkow Aigupta pren kowi kowh nar lup changra hownia en uang lawngla khai. Naiawng en uang lawngla mih khin khe amatni naring nakaw en kownkow amatni pur kowi dow akri kraingma mih lup hai kramra uowima mih lup en chang pe khai. En kowh maru Israeluüa vüi amatni pur hownia akeng mih chenchapuüa kowi en prütta pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 17:22" />Israeluüa kowi dow chowngchowng saksakma vüi en kowh maru en changla khai. Aw CHAKRAMANG, en dow amatni kowh Thurai en chowng khai.<verse eid="1CH 17:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 17:23" />“Now kawmat mih aw CHAKRAMANG, en kowh nar ang hai ang krungchakuüa lawnguan kowi kowh en takhamta mih chowngchowng saksakma townah reng diah. Nami dow en takhamta mih iawng changah diah. <verse eid="1CH 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 17:24" />Nahanow en kowh ming dow chowngchowng saksakma akri akraingma naown kown towbowt. Now maru-uüa mih, ‘Lang kri lang kraing mih CHAKRAMANG chowtaih Israel kowh Thurai,’ padow natek kown. Now en pur kowi dow en kowh nar David krungchakuüa mih anikma nauowi bowt kown. <verse eid="1CH 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 17:25" />Aw ang kowh Thurai, ang krungchak hownia mang nauang uowi kown mih en phuang ang khai. Naiawng rakowi maiawng en tut-e ang uam lü mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 17:26" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, en chowtaih Thurai. Mami aiungma mih laikham dow ang tut-e en khamah khai. <verse eid="1CH 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 17:27" />En pur kowi chowngchowng saksakma ang kowh krungchakuüa naia uowila reng kownkow peah prasi khai. Aw CHAKRAMANG, mami krungchakuüa kowi en matia ngengche peah prasi khowk chedow mami krungchakuüa dow chowngchowng saksakma naka prasi kown towbowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 17:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="1CH 18" />
  <para style="s">Akeng chenchapuüa kowi David nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 18:1" />Akung kowi David dow Filistinuüa kowi senah hanow nowngta khai. Now Filistinuüa kowh Gat marow hai ariaret kowi kowh kua maten aia powngta pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 18:2" />David dow Moabuüa kowi senah hanow nowngta khai. Nahanow Moabuüa dow David kowh nar chowng hanow aia kowi peah <char style="w">mangmu</char> büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 18:3" />Nami klen kowi mang David dow mang Hadadezer kowi Hamat marow kowi senah hanow nowngta khai. Naiawng David senah mih dow Iufratis aw re-e kowh aia kowh krawng bawn nakrawi plan powng iawk kownkow mang Hadadezer uang tarü mih khin khe chekhai. Mang Hadadezer dow Siria pren kowi kowh Zoba marow mang chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 18:4" />David dow mang Hadadezer kowh kawrnga kari 1,000, kawrnga kowi kowh chowm mih 7,000 ia siphaiuüa hai khawk hown kowh mang mih 20,000 ia siphaiuüa kowi hawt khümta khai. Aia dow amatni kowh kawrnga kari pungmadawng hownia 100 klüng towah khai, now akeng mih kawrnga maten kowi dow tüngta pe uowntüng sa bowk khai.<verse eid="1CH 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 18:5" />Nami khin khe Damaska marow kowi kowh Siriauüa dow mang Hadadezer kowi uang tawi khowngah tasen kownkow uang büah khai. Nakhowk khe David dow amatni kowh maru iun 22,000 ia kowi hawt saita pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 18:6" />Now Siria pren kowi kowh Damaska marow kowi David tow pe siphai hawmh khai. Nahanow Siriauüa dow David kowh nar chowng hanow aia kowi peah mangmu büah khai. CHAKRAMANG dow David cham kowi rah towng kowi pe awngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 18:7" />David mih mang Hadadezer kowh maru iukuüa kowh kuh kawngma ün Jerusalem marow kowi uang pawla khai. <verse eid="1CH 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 18:8" />Now Hadadezer kowh Teba hai Kun marow hownia paw mang David mih kri ahuma uang pawla khai. Naiawngün kri hown mang Sawlawmawn mih puh aiukma mih, kimchüng hai akeng mih uanh thawpla khai.<verse eid="1CH 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1CH 18:9-10" />Hamat marow mang Tawi hai mang Hadadezer iüah dow ransu chekhai. Amatchi dow khin khin tadowk tasen reng. Naiawng rakowi Hadadezer kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi David saita mih satang tata hanow mang Tawi dow awmrawm khai. Naiawng rakowi David kowi nauang kiowriah kownkow mang Tawi dow achapa Hadoram<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:9-10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hadoram </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami ming tawngbak mih Baibul kowi dow Joram pahai arui uowi ne chekhai.</char></note> kowi David tut-e uang chinah khai. Now Hadoram dow David vüi kuh uanh, tai uanh hai kri uanh ün uang pawla pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 18:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 18:11" />Now mang David mih Edawmuüa, Moabuüa, Amawnuüa, Filistinuüa hai Amalekuüa hownia kowh kaah mih kuh hai tai maten paw CHAKRAMANG vüi lang kraah khai.<verse eid="1CH 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 18:12" />Zerui kowh chapa Abisai dow Awisa lawngrawi kowi Edawmuüa kowi saita 18,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 18:13" />Edawm pren kowi kowh arah sangrum kowi David mih tow pe siphai hawmh khai. Nahanow Edawmuüa maten dow David kowh nar chowng khai bowt. CHAKRAMANG dow David cham kowi rah towng kowi pe awngah reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">David kowh maru iukuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 18:14" />David dow Israeluüa pren paprenma luk kowi chowm mang khai. Aia dow aia kowh maru-uüa luk kowi tara nowm chet pe reng, now aiungma kruitownah reng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 18:15" />Zerui kowh chapa Joab dow David kowh siphai lang kri mih chekhai. Now Ahilud kowh chapa Jehosafat dow mang kowh chownglawng lawnguan rui mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 18:16" />Ahitub kowh chapa Zadawk hai Abiathar kowh chapa Ahimelek iüah dow uamow chekhai. Now Seraia dow cha rui mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 18:17" />Mang chawng mih kowi kowh lang kri mih dow Jehoiada chapa Benaia chekhai. Now David kowh chapauüa dow mang kowh lang kri mih aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 18:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="1CH 19" />
  <para style="s">Amawnuüa hown mang David tasen mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 19:1" />Nami kung kowi Amawnuüa kowh mang Nahas dow kowng khai bowt. Now achapa Hanun dow aia takcha kowi ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 19:2" />David tek mih, “Hanun kowh pa Nahas ang luk kowi kaah sakowmma uowi iawng achapa Hanun luk kowi paw kaah sakowmma ang nauowi pe kown,” pakhai. Naiawng rakowi Hanun kowh pa kowng mih lawnguan kowi nauang tawi tek pe sakklamra laiklow kownkow David mih aia kowh maru iukuüa kowi uang chin pe pre sum ia khai. Nahanow David kowh maru iukuüa dow Hanun kowi nakowtek pe sakklamra laiklow kownkow Amawnuüa pren kowi kowkowi khai bowt. <verse eid="1CH 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 19:3" />Nachenganchepaw nakhowk khe mang Hanun kowi Amawnuüa kowh aluchowuüa uang tek pe mih, “En pa kowi ringkawah rakowi nauang tek en sakklamra laiklow kownkow naiawngün maru-uüa kowi David uang chinah mih pabow en ka tuak? Naiawngünuüa kowi David uang chinah mih dow a-i kowh pren krawi kumüla hanow akung kowi uang ta sen a-i kownkow chowbowt,” pakhai. <verse eid="1CH 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 19:4" />Naiawng rakowi Hanun dow David kowh maru-uüa kowi hawt khümah khai. Now amatni kowi dow khaita pe mawmpawi khai, now kowrmow athawngma mih paw kelang mowr chi kepta pe bowk khai. Mang Hanun dow naiawng amatni kowi peah rukrai hanow chinta khai bowt.<verse eid="1CH 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 19:5" />Nakhowk khe amatni dow kim kowi kowmang kown mih lainowmma rukrai khai bowt. Naiawngün lawnguan dow David kowi maru kowtek pe khai. Now David dow naiawngün maru hown nauang takrum kownkow kowchin pe maru pre sum ia khai. Nakhowk khe David krawi tek pe mih, “Enni kowh mawmpawi adawngma awr awm dowi mowr Jeriko marow kowi uowi büah diah towbowt. Nami kung kowi phai uang mang büah iang,” pape khai.<verse eid="1CH 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 19:6" />Now Amawnuüa dow amatni kowi lainowmma David kunmarauah mih tuk khai bowt. Naiawng rakowi Hanun hai Amawn chapauüa mih Aram-Naharaim, Aram-Maka hai Zoba büah hownia kawrnga kari hai kawrnga kari te miuüa kowi nauang ngala kownkow tai 34,000 set krawi sa pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 19:7" />Amatni dow kawrnga kari 32,000 klüng hai siphaiuüa hailawm mang Maka kowi mih ngaah büah khai. Nahanow mang Maka hai aia siphaiuüa dow Medeba marow re-e uang khup tangbung khai. Now Amawnuüa paw natasen kownkow takua talawm hanow amatni chowlowkkow marow hownia uang lawt khai, now Medeba marow kowi kowkowi khai.<verse eid="1CH 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 19:8" />Nami satang tata hanow David dow Amawnuüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow Joab hai aia kowh siphaiuüa maten kowi kowchinah khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 19:9" />Amawnuüa kowh siphai hawmh dow natasen kownkow uang lawt hanow marow tapplawt kowi uang uowi büah khai. Now akeng hownia kowh uang mih manguüa dow dowm kowi uowi büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 19:10" />Now Joab dow aia pur prakowi hai kung prakowi Siria siphaiuüa uowi mih khita khai. Naiawng rakowi aia dow aia siphaiuüa kowi ruiah sangrum hanow Siria siphaiuüa kowi nasenah kownkow towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 19:11" />Now akeng mih siphaiuüa kowi dow ataimow Abisai rut kowi ap pe khai. Now amatni kowi dow Amawnuüa kowi nasenah kownkow towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 19:12" />Joab tek pe ataimow mih, “Siriauüa che ang lak-e lang kür khai hanow en nauang khowng ang kown takla. Now Amawnuüa che en lak-e lang kür khai hanow ang nauang khowng en kown taih. <verse eid="1CH 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 19:13" />Sakkraingma hown a-i uowi diah sik! Now a-i kowh maru-uüa vüi hai a-i kowh Thurai kowh marow maten vüi sakkraingma hown a-i dowk tasen diah sik. CHAKRAMANG dow aia tut-e iung iawng nachangla kownkow ang nachup a-i Thurai kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 19:14" />Nahanow Joab dow aia kowh siphaiuüa hown Siriauüa kowi nakowsenah kownkow tarü khai bowt. Nakhowk khe Siriauüa dow amatni pur hownia powt khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 19:15" />Naiawng Siriauüa powt mih khita hanow Amawnuüa paw Joab kowh naumow Abisai pur hownia powt khai, now amatni dow marow kowi kowkup khai. Nami kung kowi dow Joab mih Jerusalem marow kowi plan khai.<verse eid="1CH 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 19:16" />Siriauüa dow Israeluüa kowi nowng dowi bowt mih tuk khai. Now amatni dow Iufratis aw paipra pown kowi kowh uowi mih Siriauüa kowi nauang hawla kownkow kowchin maru hanow uang hawla khai. Now uang hawla mih maru-uüa luk kowi chang aluchow mih dow mang Hadadezer kowh siphai aluchow Sobak chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 19:17" />Nami satang tata kung kowi David dow Israel siphaiuüa maten kowi kuaah lawmah khai. Now amatni dow haipown Jawrdan aw hanow Siriauüa kowi nakrawi kingküaah kownkow tarü khai. Now Siriauüa kowi nasenah kownkow amatni pur kowi mang David mih aia kowh siphaiuüa kowi towah khai. Nami kung kowi amatni dow Siriauüa hown tasen khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 19:18" />Nachenganchepaw Siriauüa dow Israeluüa pur hownia plan powt khai iawk. Nakhowk khe David dow amatni kowh kawrnga kari te mih maru 7,000<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">7,000 ia </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pami maru iun lawnguan kowi 2 Samuel 10:18 kowi dow 700 ia pahai arui uowi chekhai.</char></note> ia kowi hai khawk hown kowh mang mih siphai 40,000 ia kowi saita khai. Now amatni kowh siphai aluchow Sobak kowi paw aia saita khai. <verse eid="1CH 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 19:19" />Now amatni dow Israeluüa tut-e sum mih chowbowt pami Hadadezer nimkrüa kowi kowh uowi mih manguüa tuk khai bowt, now Israeluüa hown taking tasangra laikham tatow büah khai bowt. Nahanow amatni dow Israeluüa kowh nar chowng khai bowt. Nami hownia bowt now Siriauüa dow Amawnuüa kowi natawi khowngah kown mih nauta dowi bowt chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 19:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="1CH 20" />
  <para style="s">Rabba marow David powngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 20:1" />Chungrau khin chur prakowi manguüa dow cham tasen reng chekhai. Nakhowk khe Joab paw cham tasen kownkow aia kowh siphaiuüa hown cham tarü khai. Aia dow Amawnuüa pren piakta pe hanow Rabba marow kri mih umta pe lut khai. Now nami marow dow Joab mih senah hanow piakta pe khai. Nachenganchepaw nami khin khe David dow Jerusalem marow kowi ta uowi khai.<verse eid="1CH 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 20:2" />Now Rabba marow kowi David kowting khe Amawnuüa mang kowh lukruk mih lu hownia David pawta pe khai. Nami lukruk dow kuh 34 set ngia hown kowh thawpah mih chekhai, now nami lukruk kowi asung khakma mih hua paw dan pe khai. Nami lukruk dow David kowh lu kowi kruk pe khai. Nami khin khe nami marow hownia mih uanh ahuma David pawla khai. <verse eid="1CH 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 20:3" />David mih nami marowchakuüa kowi dow uang lawtla hanow kür hown sawksak, marek hai singh lup chang müa lawngha uanh hown pe changah lup khai. Now Amawnuüa kowh akeng mih marow maten kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi paw naiawng David pe changah khai. Nami kung kowi dow David mih Jerusalem marow kowi kowplan mang khai bowt.<verse eid="1CH 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filistinuüa kowi David nowngta mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 20:4" />Nami kung kowi David kowh siphaiuüa mih Gezer marow kowi Filistinuüa hown tasen khai iawk. Nakhowk khe Husa krungchak Sibekai mih lainowmma iuk kro mih chenchap Sippai pami maru kowi saita lowk ia khai, now Filistinuüa dow sum khai.<verse eid="1CH 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 20:5" />Nami kung kowi paw Filistinuüa hown plan tasen hanow Jair kowh chapa Elhanan mih Gat marowchak Goliat kowh naumow Lami kowi saita khai. Lami dow Refaim krungchak chekhai. Aia kowh reh dow aiuk pawngpai khowt chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 20:6" />Nami kung kowi paw Gat marow kowi Filistinuüa hown plan tasen khai iawk. Nakhowk khe paw lainowmma iuk kro mih chenchap maru uowi lowk ia chekhai. Nami maru kowh dow arut pre pra trui kowi hai akhawk pre pra trui kowi aprüm uowi taruk klüng chi chekhai. Nami maru paw Refaim chenchap chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 20:7" />Nachenganchepaw Israel chenchap kowi nami maru khareah khe David taimow Simea kowh chapa Jonathan mih saita khai.<verse eid="1CH 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 20:8" />Naiawngün tali ia mih Filistin siphaiuüa dow Gat marow kowi kowh uowi mih Refaim chenchap chekhai. Amatni kowi dow David hai aia kowh maru-uüa mih saita khai.<verse eid="1CH 20:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="1CH 21" />
  <para style="s">Rüa siphaiuüa mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 21:1" />Akat khe <char style="w">Setan</char> dow Israeluüa kowi natowkah krat kownkow Israeluüa kowi narüaah kown mih saktuak David kowi peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 21:2" />Nakhowk khe Joab hai siphai aluchowuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “Ber-Seba marow hownia Dan marow mowr mih Israeluüa kowi rüaah büa diah. Now maru iun mün khowt chow uowi mih ang natukla kownkow enni ki rüa khowk now uang tek ang büah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 21:3" />Nachenganchepaw Joab klangah mih, “Aw mangkri, CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai dow Israeluüa kowh maru iun kawmat kowh lak-e 100 phow mowr pacham huah lah. Israeluüa dow en kowh nar kangowh chekhai. Nachenganchepaw naiawng mih lup nachang kown mih tawngplawng kowchow en tuk nau khai? Tawngplawng kowchow Israel pachenma nachang lup ngak kown mih lup en tuk chang khai?” pape khai.<verse eid="1CH 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 21:4" />Nachenganchepaw aia tekta iawng nachang kownkow Joab kowi David peah ana khai. Naiawng rakowi Joab dow Israel pren paprenma kowi krawi lenla hanow Jerusalem marow kowi uang plan khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 21:5" />Now tasen uang mih maru iun mut David kowi aia uang peah khai. Tasen uang mih nget Israel pren paprenma kowi 1,100,000 ia chekhai, now Juda pren paprenma kowi 470,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 21:6" />Naiawng khowt mih maru iun dawng kowi Benjamin krungchakuüa hai Levi krungchakuüa kowi dow Joab klowkla dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow mang David kowh ana pek mih aia tut-e dow angakma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 21:7" />Nami ana pek dow Thurai mik kowi paw angakma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi Thurai mih Israeluüa kowi ripah khai.<verse eid="1CH 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 21:8" />Nakhowk khe Thurai kowi David tek pe mih, “Mami lup ang chang mih lainowmma ang changta angak khai bowt. Nachenganchepaw sakrauma hown en nar kowh angak lawtta pe diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang dow abualama mih iawng ang changta lup khai bowt,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 21:9" />Nakhowk khe David kowh risi Gad kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, <verse eid="1CH 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 21:10" />“David tut-e kowkowi diah, now aia vüi ang khowmta pe sum chap mih ripra kowtek pe diah. Nami sum chap mih hownia aia pacham ruiah pachap lah. Now aia ruiah mih iawng aia kowi dow ang nachang pe kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 21:11" />Nakhowk khe Gad dow David tut-e kowkowiah now kowtek pe mih, “Ripra sum chap mih hownia en nau mih narui pachap kownkow CHAKRAMANG tek en khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 21:12" />Sum ning mowr khown kuak mih bow en nau? Dowdow ransu-uüa tut-e sum kowh sum la mowr cham powt mih bow en nau? Dowdow sum ni mowr pren kowi CHAKRAMANG hownia kowh kowng hawi uang kla mih bow en nau? Nami sum ni mowr mih CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih Israel pren kowi kowh arah maten kowi nakrawi piak kown. Kawmat mih en tek ang diah, uang chin ang mih kowi tawng iawng chow ang kowtek pe kown?” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 21:13" />Nakhowk khe Gad kowi David tek pe mih, “Ang kla phih mih chowbowt lowmow! Maru rut kowi dow ang mih hang pacham kla lah, CHAKRAMANG rut kowi phai ang pacham kla lah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG kowh dow saksing sanara achur uowi dowi chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 21:14" />Nahanow CHAKRAMANG dow Israel pren kowi kowng hawi uang pe tingah khai. Nami kowng hawi hown dow Israeluüa mih 70,000 ia kowng khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 21:15" />Jerusalem marow kowi napiakah kownkow CHAKRAMANG mih kramamu lowk ia kowi kowchinah khai. Nachenganchepaw naiawng kramamu kowchang kown chowbowt khe rip chamang naripah kown mih saktuak CHAKRAMANG mih plan leta khai. Nami kramamu kowi CHAKRAMANG tek pe mih, “Na khowk tak! Taingta bowt diah!” pakhai. Nami khin khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu iowng mih dow Jebus chenchap Arauna kowh cha thuara kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 21:16" />Nakhowk khe David mih kuang prakowi awr tau hanow iowng dawnglawng se Jerusalem marow prakowi CHAKRAMANG lek saidawng mih awr khi khai. Nami khita hanow David hai lawngtang aluchowuüa mih khup sala uan hanow krawng kowi tabawk krawm se CHAKRAMANG kowi chupah khai.<verse eid="1CH 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 21:17" />Nakhowk khe Thurai kowi David tek pe mih, “Narüa maru iun kown mih ana ang nadowi bow pe? Changta angak mih hai tawita mata mih dow ang chowtaih. Naiawngün maru kawmuüa dow ruapur iawng angak uowi dowi chekhai. Tawng chow amatni changta khai? Ang hai ang kimchakuüa kowi phai pe anging ripra diah. Nachenganchepaw mami kowng hawi dow en maru-uüa luk kowi hang pacham uowi tham bowt lah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 21:18" />Nakhowk khe Jebus chenchap Arauna kowh cha thuara kowi CHAKRAMANG vüi David kowi nape thawpah phuchuara lowk kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu mih Gad kowi peah ana khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 21:19" />Now CHAKRAMANG ming hown aia kowi Gad uang tek pe mih laiklow iawng khawlawt dowi kowi David mih Arauna kowh cha thuara kowi kowkowi khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 21:20" />Nami khin khe Arauna hai achapa tali ia dow iap püm thüm chekhai. Nakhowk khe CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu kowi khita hanow achapauüa dow cham tapet khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 21:21" />Nami khin khe David dow haimang hanow aia kowi Arauna hawt khita khai. Now Arauna mih aia kowh cha thuara towla kowh David pur kowi kowkowiah now krawng kowi tabawk krawm se chupah khai.<verse eid="1CH 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 21:22" />Arauna kowi David tek pe mih, “En kowh cha thuara kim pe ang diah. Kowng hawi narimla bowt kownkow nami kim re-e CHAKRAMANG vüi ang nathawp phuchuara lowk kown. Nami arah dow sum ang diah; asung chima ang nape en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 21:23" />Nakhowk khe David kowi Arauna tek pe mih, “Mangkri, en tut-e iung iawng paw hanow chang phuchua diah. Mow, nachangla tikah mih uanap kownkow phuchuaah kown mih chiala ün uowi chow. Now nachangla sawp kown mih vüi paw cha thua müa uanh hai laithawn tim ün uowi chow. Nami klen kowi nachangla kawmdi uanap kown mih vüi paw püm uowi chow. Maiawngün dow ang peta en bowk mih chowbowt,” pape khai.<verse eid="1CH 21:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 21:24" />Nachenganchepaw Arauna kowi David klangah mih, “Naiawng e nadowi. Maiawngün dow asung chima hown ang naranah ngengche kown. Aiawng kaah mih uanh hown CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai vüi ang nachang tikah mih uanap kown nadowi,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 21:25" />Nahanow David dow nami cha thuara kim sung kuh tanga set Arauna kowi peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 21:26" />Now nami arah kowi David mih thawp phuchuara lowk khai, now tikah mih uanap hai taking tasangra uanap paw changla khai. Aia dow CHAKRAMANG kowi awr hawah khai, now CHAKRAMANG mih maiawng uang klangah khai: aia dow tikah mih uanap luk kowi mukuang pren hownia uang chin pe maih khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 21:27" />Nami kung kowi dow aia kowh saidawng akawp kowi naphangta kownkow kramamu kowi CHAKRAMANG peah ana khai. <verse eid="1CH 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 21:28" />Nami khin khe Arauna kowh cha thuara re-e aia kowi CHAKRAMANG klangah mih khita hanow David dow nami re-e tikah mih uanap kutplan changla ne tak chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 21:29" />Nami khin khe süngrüp süngkangma kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG vüi Mosi thawpah mih taklowp taklangra te hai tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara dow Gibeawn kowi kowh Thurai chup rah alowngma mih arah kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 21:30" />Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG kowh kramamu saidawng kowi kram rakowi David mih Thurai naukrang natukla kownkow nami phuchuara pur kowi kowuam kowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 21:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="1CH 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 22:1" />Nami kung kowi mang David tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG Thurai kim hai Israeluüa kowh tikah mih uanap chang müa phuchuara dow makowi naphaw ngengche kown,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim thawp müa uanh David kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 22:2" />Now mang David dow Israel pren kowi kowh uowi mih prenlang maru-uüa maten kowi arasang kuaah lawmah kownkow lawt ana khai. Now naiawngünuüa pungmadawng hownia aia dow Thurai kim chang müa hua naia bawpla kownkow maru mih ruiah khai. <verse eid="1CH 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 22:3" />Now mang David dow tapplawt maten kowi kowh abüng tak müa khir vüi hai aklia müa vüi lawngha ahuma pe khai. Now aia peah mih kri dow hu lai bowt rakowi adik ia khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 22:4" />Nami klen kowi sidar singh paw ahuma aia pe khai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia kowi dow Sidawnuüa hai Turauüa mih sidar singh ahuma uang pawla pe khai.<verse eid="1CH 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 22:5" />Now David tek mih, “Ang chapa Sawlawmawn dow ning diachow reng tak, now chanlaira paw khowt pat uowi dowi tak chekhai. Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG vüi aia nathawpah kown mih kim dow pren towng maru-uüa tut-e aming anang pacham uowi lah, klangiungma pacham phaw lah, now akiow pacham uowi lah. Naiawng rakowi aia vüi dow achap kawm ang nakamrütla pe bowk kown,” pakhai. Naiawng hai mang David dow aia kowng dowi rawn uanh ahuma kamrütla pe khai.<verse eid="1CH 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih kurdik Sawlawmawn kowi peah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 22:6" />Nami kung kowi aia dow achapa Sawlawmawn kowi hawah hanow CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai kim nachang kown mih kurdik peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 22:7" />David tek pe Sawlawmawn mih, “Pa, CHAKRAMANG ang kowh Thurai kowi natüngla ringkawra kownkow nathawp Thurai chup kim lowk kown mih ang sak kowi uowi chowdiah. <verse eid="1CH 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 22:8" />Tawkchedow CHAKRAMANG tek ang mih, ‘En saita maru mih ahuma khowk chekhai, now en cham tasen mih paw ahuma khowk chekhai. Ang pur kowi en saita maru mih hu lai bowt. Naiawng rakowi ang vüi en naia thawp kim kown nadowi. <verse eid="1CH 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 22:9" />Nachenganchepaw en naka chapa lowk ia kown; aia dow thaulangma mih maru naown kown. Aia riaret kowi kowh ransu-uüa hownia aia kowi dow thaulangma ang natowah kown. Aia kowh ming dow Sawlawmawn naown kown. (Sawlawmawn pami dow “Thaulangma” pami chekhai). Tawngplawng kowchow panow aia chowm mang mih khin khe Israeluüa kowi dow thaulangma hai aiungma ang natowah kown. <verse eid="1CH 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 22:10" />Aia dow ang vüi nathawp ang kim lowk kown. Aia dow ang kowh chapa nachowng kown, now ang dow aia kowh pa nachowng kown. Israeluüa luk kowi aia kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma ang nape uowiah kown,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 22:11" />“Pa, kawmat mih en tut-e CHAKRAMANG pacham tawi uowi reng lah. CHAKRAMANG tek iawng nachang kown mih en kowh lup pacham chawn lah. <verse eid="1CH 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 22:12" />Israeluüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik en ka mih khin khe CHAKRAMANG en kowh Thurai ari aiang en naia chün kownkow CHAKRAMANG dow prengia hai tukra pacham pe en lah. <verse eid="1CH 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 22:13" />Mosi hownia kowh Israeluüa kowi CHAKRAMANG peah mih ari arow hai ari aiang dow kaneuma chünah diah, nahanow en lup nachawn kown. Saktuak khawtma hai sakkraingma uowiah diah. Hangkow kram diah, now sak paw hangkow nen diah.<verse eid="1CH 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 22:14" />“Akrat pusama hown CHAKRAMANG kim vüi kuh 100,000 mawn hai tai 1,000,000 mawn ang kramla khai. Nami klen kowi kri hai lawngha dow hu lai bowt rakowi adik nowng khaiah dowi bowt chekhai. Now singh hai hua paw ang kamrütla hüah khowk. Nami kowi en paw ia kamrüt ne tak kown taih. <verse eid="1CH 22:14" /><verse number="15-16" style="v" sid="1CH 22:15-16" />En kowh dow hua bawp sara, singh hai hua hown kowh uanh thawp sarauüa ün akawmma chekhai. Nami klen kowi kuh, tai, kri hai lawngha hown kowh achap akawm tuk chang lup mih sarauüa paw akawmma chekhai. Naiawng rakowi kawmat nachang lup kown mih tarowng bowt. CHAKRAMANG dow en tut-e pacham tawi uowi reng lah,” pape khai.<verse eid="1CH 22:15-16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 22:17" />Nami kung kowi mang David dow achapa Sawlawmawn kowi natawi khowngah kim chang kownkow Israeluüa kowh aluchow maten kowi peah ana khai. David tek pe mih, <verse eid="1CH 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 22:18" />“CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai enni tut-e tawi uowila enni reng nadowi bow? Aia dow bowkbowk prakowi rip enni reng nadowi bow? CHAKRAMANG dow mami prenchak maru-uüa kowi ang rut kowi ap ang khai, now nami pren dow CHAKRAMANG hai aia kowh maru-uüa kowh uang chowng khai. <verse eid="1CH 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 22:19" />Kawmat CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi nacham kownkow enni kowh sak maiow anikma towah büa diah. Now CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla hai Thurai kowh chimsaima mih uanh ün naia towla kownkow tarowng thawp Thurai chup kim büa diah. Nami kim dow CHAKRAMANG kowi natüngla ringkawra kownkow chimsaima mih kim chekhai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 22:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="1CH 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 23:1" />David dow aia lawngtang mih nowm khowk khe achapa Sawlawmawn kowi mih Israeluüa luk kowi pe chowmah mang khai.<verse eid="1CH 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Leviuüa kowh lup bak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 23:2" />Akung kowi David dow Israeluüa kowh aluchow maten, uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowi kuaah lawmah khai. <verse eid="1CH 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 23:3" />Now 30 ning hownia 50 ning mowr mih Levi chenchap kachakuüa kowi rüaah hanow amatni kowh maru iun mut dow 38,000 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1CH 23:4-5" />Naiawngünuüa pungmadawng hownia CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh lup chang miuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kowi tabak mih dow 24,000 ia, maru iuk hai tara chet mih kowi tabak mih dow 6,000 ia, kangchawng mih kowi tabak mih dow 4,000 ia, now David pe thawpah mih tünteu chang müa hown nakiow CHAKRAMANG kown mih kowi tabak mih dow 4,000 ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 23:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 23:6" />Levi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn, Kohat hai Merari büah chekhai. Amatni kowi dow amatni krungchak iawng David changah sum thum khai.<verse eid="1CH 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gersawn krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 23:7" />Gersawn kowh chapauüa dow Ladan hai Simei iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:7" /><verse number="8-9" style="v" sid="1CH 23:8-9" />Ladan kowh lang ta mih chapa dow Jehiel chekhai, now nami kung kowi dow Zetham hai Joel iüah chekhai. Naiawngünuüa dow Ladan krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. Simei kowh chapauüa dow Selomawt, Haziel hai Haran büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:8-9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 23:10" />Simei kowh akeng mih chapauüa dow Jahat, Zina, Jeus hai Beria büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 23:11" />Amatni tainau kowi lang ta mih dow Jahat, now nami kung kowi dow Zina chekhai. Tawkche Jeus hai Beria iüah kowh dow chapauüa e lai rakowi amatchi pre ia kowi klowkah pakrungchak chowtaih.<verse eid="1CH 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kohat krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 23:12" />Kohat kowh chapauüa dow Amram, Izhar, Hebrawn hai Uziel büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 23:13" />Amram kowh chapauüa dow Arawn hai Mosi iüah chekhai. Arawn hai aia krungchakuüa kowi dow Thurai vüi chowngchowng saksakma naia changla lup reng kownkow lang krata khai bowt. Amatni kowi lang kraah mih dow lang <char style="w">chimsai</char> mih uanh naming nakhet kownkow, CHAKRAMANG pur kowi naia chang uanap pawi kownkow, aia pur kowi naia chang lup kownkow hai aia ming hown naia pe prasi kownkow chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 23:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 23:14" />Tawkche Thurai maru Mosi kowh krungchak kowi dow Levi chenchap kowi klowkla khai. <verse eid="1CH 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 23:15" />Mosi kowh chapauüa dow Gersawn hai Eliezer iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 23:16" />Gersawn kowh lang ta mih chapa dow Sebuel chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 23:17" />Eliezer kowh dow Rehabia pami chapa lowk iachow taih. Tawkchedow Rehabia kowh dow krungchakuüa uowi ahuma chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 23:18" />Izhar kowh lang ta mih chapa dow Selomit chekhai. (Izhar dow Kohat kowh chapa ta dakchow kowi kowh chapa chekhai). <verse eid="1CH 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 23:19" />Hebrawn kowh lang ta mih chapa dow Jeria, now nami kung kowi dow Amaria, Jahaziel hai Jekameam büah chekhai. (Hebrawn dow Izhar dakchow kowi kowh dia mih chekhai). <verse eid="1CH 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 23:20" />Uziel kowh lang ta mih chapa dow Mika, now asawi mih dow Isia chekhai. (Uziel dow Hebrawn dakchow kowi kowh dia mih chekhai).<verse eid="1CH 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Merari krungchakuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 23:21" />Merari kowh chapauüa dow Mali hai Musi chekhai. Mali kowh chapauüa dow Eleazar hai Kis chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 23:22" />Eleazar kowh dow lowk iachow paw chapa uowi dowi; aia kowh dow chama kangowh chekhai. Naiawngün masiuüa dow amatni kowh pahi Kis kowh chapauüa hown tachawng khai. <verse eid="1CH 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 23:23" />Musi kowh chapauüa dow Mali, Eder hai Jerimawt büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 23:24" />Naiawngün dow Levi chenchap kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchakuüa kowh aluchowuüa chekhai. Naiawngün krungchak maru-uüa kowi dow pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa maten kowi tang pe ming khai. Now amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi pe changah lup khai. <verse eid="1CH 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 23:25" />David tek mih, “CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow aia maru-uüa kowi peah thaulangra khai bowt, now Jerusalem kowi chowngchowng saksakma vüi nauang uowi bowt kown. <verse eid="1CH 23:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 23:26" />Naiawng rakowi Leviuüa dow taklowp taklangra te hai nakowi kowh tawngah mih uanh maten akawt takla dowi bowt tham,” pakhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 23:27" />Achur kowi kowh David ana pek iawng Leviuüa kowi dow pirmi ning chih mih hownia nami luk kowi kowh kachakuüa maten kowi tang pe ming khai.<verse eid="1CH 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 23:28" />Naiawngün Leviuüa kowh lup dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh lup chang mih Arawn krungchakuüa kowi tawi khowngah kown mih chekhai. Amatni dow CHAKRAMANG kim viadawng hai towklak ün tawi mingkhet khai, chimsaima mih uanh ün chimsaima tawi chang khai, now CHAKRAMANG kim kowi lakke takla mih lup paw tawi chang khai. <verse eid="1CH 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 23:29" />Nami klen kowi amatni kowh lup dow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nakowtow kawmpah kown mih, kawmdi uanap vüi nalang klo kawmdi kown mih, the pe tuah dowi mih kawm nathawp kown mih, naawp kawmpah kown mih hai kanrawn sau hown nalawk kawmdi kown mih chekhai. Now amatni dow maru-uüa uang pawla mih uanap adik khai chih chow chih dowi chow mih paw nahawt mü kown mih chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 23:29" /><verse number="30-31" style="v" sid="1CH 23:30-31" />Amatni dow rau towng hai iak pra towng CHAKRAMANG kowi tek awmrawm lai hai kiowah reng chekhai. Now Tanai Ni khe, Lacher Pawi khe hai khowm bowkta mih pawi khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tikah mih uanap chang kowi tawi khowng reng chekhai. Amatni dow khowm bowkta mih maru iun khowt chi amatni kowi kowh peah mih lup bak iawng atungma CHAKRAMANG pur kowi chang reng chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 23:30-31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 23:32" />Naiawng hai Leviuüa dow uamowuüa nimkrüa kowi taklowp taklangra te, CHAKRAMANG chup kim hai nakowi kowh achang takla mih lup chang büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 23:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="1CH 24" />
  <para style="s">Uamowuüa kowi athum athumchow bakah mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 24:1" />Arawn krungchakuüa kowi dow maiawng bakah khai. Arawn kowh chapauüa dow Nadab, Abihu, Eleazar hai Ithamar büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 24:2" />Nadab hai Abihu iüah dow a-pa Arawn sing uowi reng tak khe kala chah dowi kowi kowng khai. Naiawng rakowi Eleazar hai Ithamar iüah mih ta chang uamow lup khai. <verse eid="1CH 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 24:3" />Arawn kowh krungchak kowi dow nabowk pe uamow lup kownkow athum athumchow David bakah khai. Nakhowk khe David kowi tawi khowngah mih dow Eleazar kowh krungchak Zadawk hai Ithamar kowh krungchak Ahimelek iüah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 24:4" />Ithamar krungchak lak-e Eleazar krungchak dow maru iun lang kawm khai rakowi aluchow paw lang kawm khai. Naiawng rakowi Eleazar krungchak kowi laitaruk ia aluchow vüi laitaruk thum David bakah khai, now Ithamar krungchak kowi dow aluchow raiat ia vüi raiat thum David bakah khai. <verse eid="1CH 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 24:5" />Eleazar hai Ithamar krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Thurai chup kim kowi hai Thurai kowh lup chang miuüa chekhai rakowi tawng pra paw tangila dowi kowi kuak pe plang hanow uamow lup mih bak pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 24:6" />Eleazar krungchak hai Ithamar krungchak vüi dow taleah lütlüt kuak pe plang khai. Now mang David hai aia kowh maru iukuüa, uamow Zadawk, Abiathar kowh chapa Ahimelek, uamow krungchak hownia kowh aluchowuüa hai Leviuüa pur kowi Nethanel kowh chapa Semaia mih kuak plang khe kowh plang cha miuüa kowh ming mih ming tang bowih kowi rui pe khai. Semaia dow Levi krungchak hownia kowh cha rui mih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 24:7" />Naiawng rik kuak plang khe kowh ming uang paw mih dow Jehoiarib ming chekhai, pre kat kowi dow Jedaia ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 24:8" />sum kat kowi dow Harim ming, tali kat kowi dow Seawrim ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 24:9" />tanga kat kowi dow Malkija ming, taruk kat kowi dow Mijamin ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 24:10" />ranit kat kowi dow Hakawz ming, raiat kat kowi dow Abija ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 24:11" />taku kat kowi dow Jesua ming, hamüt kat kowi dow Sekania ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 24:12" />lailowk kat kowi dow Eliasib ming, laipre kat kowi dow Jakim ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 24:13" />laisum kat kowi dow Hupa ming, laitali kat kowi dow Jesebeab ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 24:14" />laitanga kat kowi dow Bilga ming, laitaruk kat kowi dow Imer ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 24:15" />lairanit kat kowi dow Hezir ming, lairaiat kat kowi dow Hapizer ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 24:16" />laitaku kat kowi dow Pethahia ming, pirmi kat kowi dow Jehezkel ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 24:17" />pirmi lailowk kat kowi dow Jakin ming, pirmi laipre kat kowi dow Gamul ming, <verse eid="1CH 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 24:18" />pirmi laisum kat kowi dow Delaia ming, now pirmi laitali kat kowi dow Mazia ming chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 24:19" />Amatni kowi dow amatni pipu-uüa Arawn kowi kowh CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai peah mih ana iawng CHAKRAMANG kim kowi nachang lup kownkow khowm pe bowk pe lup khai.<verse eid="1CH 24:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20-21" style="v" sid="1CH 24:20-21" />Levi chuprek chaprek kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa dow maiawng: Amram krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Sebuel, Sebuel krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Jedeia, now Rehabia krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Isia. <verse eid="1CH 24:20-21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 24:22" />Izhar krungchak aluchow dow Selomit, Selomit krungchak aluchow dow Jahat chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 24:23" />Now Hebrawn krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Jeria, Amaria, Jahaziel hai Jekameam büah chekhai. Now amatni pungmadawng kowi kowh lang kri mih dow Jeria chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:23" /><verse number="24-25" style="v" sid="1CH 24:24-25" />Uziel krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Mika chekhai. Mika krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Samir hai Isia chekhai. (Isia dow Mika naumow chekhai). Isia krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Zekaria chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:24-25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 24:26" />Merari krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Mali hai Musi chekhai. Jazia krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Beno chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 24:27" />Merari chapa Jazia kowh chapauüa dow Soham, Zakur hai Ibri büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 24:28" />Mali krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Eleazar. Eleazar kowh dow chapa uowi dowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 24:29" />Kis krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Jeramel, <verse eid="1CH 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 24:30" />Musi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Mali, Eder hai Jerimawt büah chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 24:30">Levi chuprek chaprek kowi kowh chowlowkkow krungchak aluchowuüa dow naiawngünuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 24:31" />Amatni kowi dow mang David, Zadawk, Ahimelek, uamow hai Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa pur kowi amatni kowh tainau Arawn krungchakuüa kowi iawng kuak pe plang khai. Amatni kowi dow ataimow lah, anaumow lah naiawng hai kuak pe plang hanow bak pe lup khai.<verse eid="1CH 24:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="1CH 25" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim kowi kowh meng tek miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 25:1" />Mang David hai Levi krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa dow Thurai chup kim kowi pe changah lup kownkow Asaf kowh krungchakuüa, Heman kowh krungchakuüa hai Jeduthun kowh krungchakuüa kowi lang kraah khai. Naiawng amatni kowi lang kraah mih dow tingteng, taraw, klingchow hai meng tün hown naia phuangla Thurai lai kownkow chekhai. Naiawngün lup chang miuüa dow <verse eid="1CH 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 25:2" />Asaf kowh chapa Zakur, Josef, Nethania hai Asarela büah chekhai. Amatni kowh lup kowi dow a-pa Asaf mih kruitownah khai, now mang David peah ana mih khin khe meng hown phuang Thurai lai büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 25:3" />Jeduthun kowh chapa Gedalia, Zeri, Jesaia, Simei, Hasabia hai Matithia büah chekhai. Amatni dow a-pa Jeduthun kruitownah mih iawng chang khai. Jeduthun dow tepla taraw se meng hown phuang Thurai lai khai, now Thurai kowi kiowah hai tek pe awmrawm lai khai. <verse eid="1CH 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 25:4" />Heman kowh chapa Bukia, Matania, Uziel, Sebuel, Jerimawt, Hanania, Hanani, Eliatha, Gidalti, Romamti-Ezer, Jawsbekasa, Malothi, Hothir hai Mahaziawt büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 25:5" />Naiawngünuüa laitali ia mih dow mang kowh risi Heman kowh chapauüa chekhai. Naiawngün chapauüa Heman kowi Thurai peah mih dow Heman kowi nape kürah ngamlam kownkow chekhai, now Heman kowh dow chama paw uowi sum ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 25:6" />Amatni bowkbowk dow Thurai chup kim kowi nachang lup kownkow amatni kowh pa Asaf, Jeduthun hai Heman büah kruitownah iawng uowi khai. Now mang kowh ana pek iawng amatni dow klingchow, tingteng, taraw hai meng hown rowsi Thurai khai. <verse eid="1CH 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 25:7" />Amatni kowh krungchak hownia CHAKRAMANG vüi rowsi meng tek atukma mih hai tünteu tep akiakma miuüa dow bowkbowk kowi 288 ia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 25:8" />Now aiuk, asowm, tüngsang mih hai sang miuüa bowkbowk vüi kuak pe plang hanow amatni kowh lup dow tabowkah büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9-31" style="v" sid="1CH 25:9-31" />Naiawngün 288 ia maru kowi amatni dow laipre ia e pathum chi 24 thum changah khai. Rik kuakah mih plang kowi plang cha mih dow Asaf machak Josef ming chekhai, nami kung kowi dow Gedalia, nami kung kowi dow Zakur, nami kung kowi dow Zeri, nami kung kowi dow Nethania, nami kung kowi dow Bukia, nami kung kowi dow Asarela, nami kung kowi dow Jesaia, nami kung kowi dow Matania, nami kung kowi dow Simei, nami kung kowi dow Uziel, nami kung kowi dow Hasabia, nami kung kowi dow Sebuel, nami kung kowi dow Matithia, nami kung kowi dow Jerimawt, nami kung kowi dow Hanani, nami kung kowi dow Jawsbekasa, nami kung kowi dow Hanani, nami kung kowi dow Malothi, nami kung kowi dow Eliatha, nami kung kowi dow Hothir, nami kung kowi dow Gidalti, nami kung kowi dow Mahaziawt, now achur kowi kowh plang cha mih dow Romamti-Ezer ming chekhai. Naiawngün aluchow 24 ia miuüa hown dow amatni kowh chapauüa hai tasin taken miuüa uowi laipre ia chi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 25:9-31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="1CH 26" />
  <para style="s">Kangchawng miuüa tabak thumchak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 26:1" />Mami dow nachawng Thurai chup kim kownkow Levi krungchakuüa tabak thumchak mih lawnguan chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 26:1">Kora chuprek chaprekuüa hownia dow Asaf krungchak kowi kowh Kore kowh chapa Meselemia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 26:2" />Meselemia kowh chapa ta dow Zekaria, now nami kung kowi dow Jediael, Zebadia, Jatniel, <verse eid="1CH 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 26:3" />Elam, Jehohanan hai Eliehoenai büah chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1CH 26:4-5" />Obed-Edawm paw kangchawng mih chekhai. Aia dow Thurai prasi hown ka chapa raiat ia khai. Naiawngünuüa dow Semaia, Jehozabad, Joa, Sakhar, Nethanel, Amiel, Isakar hai Peuletai büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:4-5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 26:6" />Now Obed-Edawm kowh chapa ta Semaia kowh paw chapa uowi taruk ia chekhai. Amatni dow Obed-Edawm krungchak kowi kowh aluchow kangowh chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow amatni dow tasen kiakma kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 26:7" />Semaia kowh chapauüa dow Awtni, Rafael, Obed, Elzabad, Elihu hai Semakia büah chekhai. Semaia krungchak kowi kowh Elihu hai Semakia iüah paw akürma chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 26:8" />Obed-Edawm krungchak hownia tawi chang kangchawng lup mih dow bowkbowk kowi 62 ia chekhai. Amatni dow akürma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 26:9" />Meselemia krungchakuüa hownia tawi chang kangchawng lup mih dow bowkbowk kowi lairaiat ia chekhai. Amatni dow lup chang kiakma kangowh chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10-11" style="v" sid="1CH 26:10-11" />Merari chuprek chaprek Hosa kowh dow chapa uowi tali ia chekhai: Simri, Hilkia, Tebalia hai Zekaria büah chekhai. Simri kowi dow chapa ta nadowi chepaw aluchow mih rah a-pa Hosa peah khai. Hosa kimchak hownia kowh tawi chang kangchawng lup mih dow bowkbowk kowi laisum ia chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:10-11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 26:12" />Pathum pathumchow bakah mih kangchawng miuüa dow amatni kowh aluchowuüa nimkrüa kowi uowi büah khai, now amatni krungchak kowi kowh akeng mih Leviuüa iawng CHAKRAMANG kim kowi natawi chang lup kown mih kurdik ka büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 26:13" />Amatni dow tawng mih kimplawt chow nachawng kown mih kowi aiuk asowm bowkbowk vüi kuak pe plang hanow takhowm tabowkah khai.<verse eid="1CH 26:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 26:14" />Nahanow satlawt prakowi kowh tapplawt nachawng kown mih vüi kuak plang khe kowh ming uang paw mih dow Selemia ming chekhai. Now tawngphak prakowi kowh tapplawt nachawng kown mih vüi kuak plang khe kowh ming uang paw mih dow achapa Zekaria ming chekhai. Zekaria dow chanlaima mih prengia pek mih maru chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 26:15" />Mrawkphak prakowi kowh tapplawt vüi kuak plang khe kowh ming uang paw mih dow Obed-Edawm ming chekhai, now dawngthawnguan towk rah kim khet mih vüi kuak plang khe kowh ming uang paw mih dow achapauüa ming chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:15" /><verse number="16-17" style="v" sid="1CH 26:16-17" />Now satkup prakowi kowh tapplawt vüi kuak plang khe kowh ming uang paw mih dow Supim hai Hosa iüah ming chekhai. Nami tapplawt dow Saleket pami tapplawt re-e chekhai; Saleket tapplawt dow Thurai chup kim pra kowh mangla mih tiama kowi chekhai. Amatni dow ni towng nachawng tapplawt kownkow taleah büah khai. Amatni dow ni towng satlawt prakowi taruk ia, tawngphak prakowi tali ia, mrawkphak prakowi tali ia chi chawng kang büah khai, now dawngthawnguan towk rah kim kowi dow pre ia chi chawng kang büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 26:16-17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 26:18" />Satkup prakowi kowh viadawng kowi pre ia, now viadawng uat kowi kowh tiama kowi tali ia chawng kang büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 26:19" />Naiawngün kangchawng miuüa dow Kora krungchak hai Merari krungchak hownia kowh chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dawngthawnguan towk rah kim khet mih hai akeng lup chang miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 26:20" />Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kim khet mih hai Thurai vüi kowi kowh lang kraah mih dawngthawnguan khet mih dow akeng mih Levi krungchak kowi towah khai. Naiawngün Leviuüa kowh aluchow dow Ahija chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21-22" style="v" sid="1CH 26:21-22" />Gersawn krungchak Jehiel dow Ladan chapa chekhai. Jehiel chapa Zetham hai Joel iüah kowi dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kim mingkhet mih towah khai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:21-22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 26:23" />Nami klen kowi Kohat krungchak Amram, Izhar, Hebrawn hai Uziel büah machakuüa kowi paw dawngthawnguan towk rah kim nakhet kown mih kurdik pela khai. <verse eid="1CH 26:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 26:24" />Gersawn machak Subael dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan mingkhet mih kowi kowh lang kri mih chekhai. Gersawn dow Mosi kowh chapa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 26:25" />Nami klen kowi nami lup chang miuüa dow Gersawn kowh naumow Eliezer krungchak chekhai. Eliezer kowh chapa dow Rehabia, Rehabia kowh chapa Jesaia, Jesaia kowh chapa Joram, Joram kowh chapa Zikri, Zikri kowh chapa Selomit chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 26:26" />Mang David, Israel krungchak aluchowuüa, 100 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa, 1,000 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa hai siphai aluchowuüa kowh lang kri miuüa lang kraah mih Thurai vüi dawngthawnguan mingkhet mih dow Selomit hai aia krungchakuüa chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 26:27" />Now tasen khe kowh amatni kala mih uanh dow CHAKRAMANG chup kim rawk müa kowi lang kraah büah chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 26:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 26:28" />Nami klen kowi risi Samuel, Kis kowh chapa Saul, Ner kowh chapa Abner hai Zerui kowh chapa Joab büah lang kraah mih Thurai vüi dawngthawnguan mingkhet mih dow Selomawt hai aia krungchakuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 26:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 26:29" />Kenania dow Izhar krungchak hownia chekhai. Aia hai aia chapauüa kowi dow Thurai chup kim kowi kowh lup chang mih nadowi kowi Israel pren kowi kowh maru iukuüa hai tara chet mih towah khai. <verse eid="1CH 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 26:30" />Hasabia dow Hebrawn krungchak hownia chekhai. Aia hai aia krungchak akürma mih 1,700 ia kowi dow Jawrdan aw satkup prakowi kowh Israeluüa luk kowi towah aluchow khai. Amatni kowi dow CHAKRAMANG vüi hai mang vüi nachang pe lup kownkow peah kurdik khai. <verse eid="1CH 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 26:31" />Hebrawn krungchak kowi kowh aluchow dow Jeria chekhai. David chowm mang mih 40 ning khe Hebrawn krungchakuüa ming tang bowih mih müah khai. Nahanow Gilead süng kowi kowh Jazer marow kowi dow Hebrawn krungchak lowra sia kowi akiakma mih maru akawmma krawi ka khai. <verse eid="1CH 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 26:32" />Naiawngün akiakma mih maru iun dow 2,700 ia chekhai. Amatni dow chowlowkkow kim kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Mang David mih Jeria hai 2,700 ia mih aluchowuüa kowi Reubenuüa, Gaduüa hai Manase krungchak dawnglang miuüa luk kowi towah aluchow khai. Amatni kowi dow Thurai kowh lup hai mang kowh lup maten nachang kownkow peah kurdik khai.<verse eid="1CH 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="1CH 27" />
  <para style="s">Siphai thumchakuüa tabak mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 27:1" />Maiawngün dow Israel krungchak aluchow, 1,000 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow, 100 ia luk kowi kowh siphai aluchow hai amatni dak kowi kowh maru iukuüa ming chekhai. Amatni dow siphai lawnguan kowi kowh achang takla mih lup chang reng chekhai. Amatni mih chowlowkkow thum kowi krawi tabak hanow ning lawng prat pala kowi pathum chi mang kowi tawi khowngah reng büah khai. Amatni dow uowi laipre thum chekhai, now athum kowi dow siphai uowi 24,000 ia chi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2-3" style="v" sid="1CH 27:2-3" />Ning towng kowh la uown kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Zabdiel kowh chapa Jasobeam luk kowi chekhai. Jasobeam dow Perez kowh chuprek chaprek chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:2-3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 27:4" />Pre la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Aho chenchap Dodai luk kowi chekhai. Aia kowh akhowng mih dow Miklawt chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 27:5" />Sum la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow uamow Jehoiada kowh chapa Benaia chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 27:6" />Benaia dow <char style="w">Hiareng</char> 30 Ia thumchak kowi kowh lowk ia mih chekhai. Aia dow nami thumchak kowi kowh aluchow chekhai. Now achapa Amizabad paw aia kowh akhowng mih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 27:7" />Tali la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Joab kowh tainau Asael chekhai. Aia kowng kung kowi dow achapa Zabdiel ta chowng aluchow khai.<verse eid="1CH 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 27:8" />Tanga la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Izra krungchak Samut chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 27:9" />Taruk la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Tekoa marowchak Ikes chapa Ira chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 27:10" />Ranit la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Pelawn marowchak Helez chekhai. Aia dow Efraim krungchak maru chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 27:11" />Raiat la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Husa marowchak Sibekai chekhai. Aia dow Zera chuprek chaprek chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 27:12" />Taku la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Anathawt marowchak Abiezer chekhai. Aia dow Benjamin chuprek chaprek chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 27:13" />Hamüt la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Netawfat marowchak Maharai chekhai. Aia dow Zera chuprek chaprek chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 27:14" />Lailowk la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Pirathawn marowchak Benaia chekhai. Aia dow Efraim chuprek chaprek chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 27:15" />Laipre la kowi 24,000 ia mih siphaiuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Netofa marowchak Heldai chekhai. Aia dow Awtniel chuprek chaprek chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel krungchakuüa kowh lang kri mih aluchowuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 27:16" />Maiawngün dow Israel krungchakuüa kowh lang kri mih aluchowuüa chekhai. Reuben krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Zikri kowh chapa Eliezer chekhai, Simiawn krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Maka kowh chapa Sefatia chekhai, <verse eid="1CH 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 27:17" />Levi krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Kemuel kowh chapa Hasabia chekhai, Arawn krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Zadawk chekhai, <verse eid="1CH 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 27:18" />Juda krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow David kowh tainau Elihu chekhai, Isakar krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Mikael kowh chapa Awmri chekhai, <verse eid="1CH 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 27:19" />Zebulun krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Obadia kowh chapa Ismaia chekhai, Naptali krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Azriel kowh chapa Jerimawt chekhai, <verse eid="1CH 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 27:20" />Efraim krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Azazia kowh chapa Hosea chekhai, Jawrdan aw satkup pra kowh Manase krungchak dawnglang mih kowh aluchow dow Pedaia kowh chapa Joel chekhai, <verse eid="1CH 27:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 27:21" />Jawrdan aw satlawt pra kowh Gilead süng kowi kowh uowi mih Manase krungchak dawnglang mih kowh aluchow dow Zekaria kowh chapa Ido chekhai, Benjamin krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Abner kowh chapa Jasiel chekhai, <verse eid="1CH 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 27:22" />Dan krungchakuüa kowh aluchow dow Jeroham kowh chapa Azarel chekhai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 27:22">Naiawngün dow Israel krungchakuüa kowi kowh lang kri mih aluchowuüa chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 27:23" />Tawkche mang David mih pirmi ning hai pirmi ning dak kowi kowh maru-uüa kowi rüala dowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG dow Israeluüa kowi mih kuang kowi kowh krek nowng rüaah dowi mih iawng maru iun kawmma nachangah kown mih khamta khowk chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 27:24" />Zerui kowh chapa Joab dow rüa maru kown mih tarowng khowk chowdiah. Nachenganchepaw aia dow chur pat rüaah dowi chekhai. Naiawng rüa maru khai rakowi Israeluüa luk kowi dow CHAKRAMANG kowh kunmaraura uang ting khai. Naiawng rakowi mang David lawnguan kowi kowh bowih kowi dow maru iun mut arui uowi dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang kowh dawngthawnguan mingkhet miuüa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 27:25" />Mang kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Adiel kowh chapa Azmavet chekhai. Krawng bawn, marow, kua hai kimkrowng kowi kowh uanh nungra maten naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Uzia kowh chapa Jonathan luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 27:26" />Üa hai laih kowi kowh lup chang miuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Kelub chapa Ezkri luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 27:27" />Grep krum naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Ramat marowchak Simei luk kowi chekhai. Grep krum hownia kowh kaah mih grep tui nungra kowi natow kown mih kurdik dow Sefam marowchak Zabdi luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 27:28" />Satkup pra kowh awkaw kowi kowh kanrawn singh hai uidut singh naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Geder marowchak Baal-Hanan luk kowi chekhai. Kanrawn sau towk rah kim naming nakhet kown mih dow Joas luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 27:29" />Sarawn süng anaima mih kowi kowh chia hawmh thing miuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Sarawn süng kowi kowh uowi mih Sitrai luk kowi chekhai, now lawngrawi kowi kowh chia thing miuüa kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Adlai kowh chapa Safat luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 27:30" />Ut hawmh kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Ismael krungchak hownia Obil luk kowi chekhai. Kawrngaramchük hawmh kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Meronawt marowchak Jedeia luk kowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="1CH 27:31" />Rua hai ruapur hawmh kowi naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow Hagar krungchak hownia Jaziz luk kowi chekhai. Mang David kowh dawngthawnguan naming nakhet kown mih kurdik dow naiawngünuüa luk kowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="1CH 27:32" />David kowh pahi Jonathan dow prengia pek mih, chanlaima mih maru hai mang kowh cha rui mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi aia kowh dow Hakmoni kowh chapa Jehiel hown mang chapauüa kowi natüng nasangah kown mih kurdik paw uowi chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="1CH 27:33" />Ahithofel dow mang kowh prengia pek mih chekhai, now Arki krungchak Husai dow mang kowh auiua chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="1CH 27:34" />Ahithofel kowng kung kowi dow Abiathar hai Benaia chapa Jehoiada iüah mih mang kowh prengia pek mih ta chowng khai. Now mang kowh siphai hawmh kowh aluchow dow Joab chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 27:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="1CH 28" />
  <para style="s">CHAKRAMANG kim chang kownkow David kamrüt mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 28:1" />Mang David dow Israeluüa kowh maru iukuüa kowi Jerusalem marow kowi arasang nauang takua talawm kownkow lawt ana khai. Naiawng rakowi krungchak towng hownia kowh aluchowuüa, mang kowh siphai kowi kowh aluchowuüa, 1,000 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa, 100 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa, mang hai mang chapauüa kowh dawngthawnguan mingkhet miuüa, mang kowh maru iukuüa hai tasen kiakma miuüa mih uang takua talawm khai.<verse eid="1CH 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 28:2" />Nakhowk khe awr iowngah hanow amatni kowi David tek pe mih, “Ang tainau-uüa hai ang kowh maru-uüa low, ang laiklow kowi pe ching büa diah. CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla towk rah kim anikma ang nathawp lowk kown mih ang nau chowdiah. Sangbowk laitawm tawkpla dow Thurai kowh khawk towk rah iawng chekhai. Nami nathawp kownkow ang kamrüt khowk chowdiah. <verse eid="1CH 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 28:3" />Nachenganchepaw Thurai tek ang mih, ‘En dow tasen reng mih maru, now cham sai sak reng chekhai. Naiawng rakowi ang vüi en naia thawp kim kown nadowi,’ pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="1CH 28:4" />“Nachenganchepaw CHAKRAMANG Israeluüa kowh Thurai dow Israeluüa luk kowi chowngchowng saksakma nachowm mang kownkow apa machak hownia lang klo ang khai. Nakruitown Israeluüa kown mih dow Juda krungchakuüa kowi aia kloah khai, now Juda chuprek chaprek hownia dow a-pa krungchak kowi aia kloah khai. Now Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow ang tainau-uüa pungmadawng hownia klo ang mih dow aia awmrawm khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1CH 28:5" />CHAKRAMANG mih ahuma pe ang chapa khai. Naiawngün chapauüa pungmadawng hownia CHAKRAMANG kowh pren Israeluüa luk kowi nachowm mang kownkow ang chapa Sawlawmawn kowi aia lang kloah khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 28:6" />Aia tek ang mih, ‘Ang kowh kim hai viadawng nathawp kown mih dow en chapa Sawlawmawn chowtaih. Tawngplawng kowchow panow ang chapa nachowng kownkow aia kowi ang lang kloah khai, now ang dow aia kowh pa nachowng kown. <verse eid="1CH 28:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 28:7" />Ang kowh ana pek hai alow pek che kawmat kowh iawng kaneuma aia chün khai hanow aia kowh mang chowm rah dow chowngchowng saksakma ang natow pe kown,’ aia pah ang khai.<verse eid="1CH 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 28:8" />“Naiawng rakowi CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai ana pek maten kaneuma nachün kownkow CHAKRAMANG kowh maru Israeluüa hai a-i kowh Thurai pur kowi ang tek enni khai. Nahanow mami klangiungma mih pren kowi enni naka uowi kown, now mami pren dow chowngchowng saksakma mih dawngthawnguan iawng enni krungchakuüa kowi enni naia apla kown towbowt.<verse eid="1CH 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn kowi David peah prengia mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 28:9" />“Ang chapa Sawlawmawn, en pa kowh Thurai kowi en tuk kown takla. Sak maiow hown aia kowi chupiia diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow maru kowh saktuak hai kamrütra dow aia tuk bowk chekhai. Aia kowi che en cham hanow aia kowi mih en naka kown. Tawkche aia kowi en nuata khai hanow aia paw chowngchowng saksakma nanuata en kown. <verse eid="1CH 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 28:10" />CHAKRAMANG kowh kim nathawp pe lowk kownkow aia mih lang klo en khai. Naiawng rakowi kaneuma pe ching diah. En mih sakkhawtma uowi diah, now thawp Thurai chup kim diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 28:11" />Nami kung kowi David dow tawng iawng chow nathawp Thurai chup kim kown mih akuh Sawlawmawn kowi peah khai: kimpuk, uanh towk rah towk lak, aluk krowng towk lak, alak kowi kowh towklak hai lang chimsai mih arah ün chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 28:12" />Nami klen kowi CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh viadawng, nami riaret kowi kowh towklak ün, uanh nungra towklak ün hai CHAKRAMANG tut-e uang ap-ah mih uanh towk rah towklak ün nathawp kownkow <char style="w">Lümlasai</char> uang tek pe mih akuh maten paw Sawlawmawn kowi aia peah khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 28:13" />David dow uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh chowlowkkow thumchakuüa kowi amatni kowh lup bak, CHAKRAMANG kim kowi achang takla mih lup maten, CHAKRAMANG kim kowi tawngkengah mih uanh maten lawnguan kowi tek pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 28:14" />CHAKRAMANG kim chang kowi mün khowt chow kuh hai tai lakke kown mih paw Sawlawmawn kowi aia tek pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 28:15" />Now kuh hai tai hown kowh maibu towng hai maibu vüi mün khowt chow kuh hai tai lakke kown mih paw aia tek pe Sawlawmawn khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 28:16" />Now CHAKRAMANG pur kowi kowh chimsaima mih kawm towk rah pawitang thawp müa kuh hai akeng mih pawitang thawp müa tai mün khowt chow lakke kown mih paw aia tek pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 28:17" />Now chaknga khowng müa kep, bia hai tuikawng chap ahuma nathawpla kownkow achangma mih kuh mün khowt chow lakke kown mih aia tek pe khai. Now akeng mih bia thawp müa mün khowt chow nalakke tai kown mih paw aia tek pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 28:18" />Nami klen kowi nam iungma mih maikhük towk müa phuchuara thawp müa mün khowt chow nalakke kuh kown mih paw aia tek pe khai. Now CHAKRAMANG kowh sangbowk laitawm tawkpla luk kowi nataiang hüah kown mih Cherup rup hai kawrnga kari thawp müa kuh achangma mih mün khowt chow lakke mih paw aia tek pe khai.<verse eid="1CH 28:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 28:19" />David tek pe mih, “Maiawngün akuh dow CHAKRAMANG tek ang khe kowh ang ruiah mih chekhai. Akuh kowi uowi iawng naia thawpla kown mih prengia dow aia pe ang khai,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 28:20" />Nami kung kowi David plan tek pe Sawlawmawn mih, “Sakkhawtma hai sakkraingma uowi diah, now chang lup diah. Hang kram diah, now hang sak nen diah. Tawngplawng kowchow panow CHAKRAMANG Thurai, ang kowh Thurai dow en tut-e tawi uowi reng. Aia kowh chup kim en ki thawp dowi mowr aia mih napowtta en kown nadowi, now nanuata en kown nadowi. <verse eid="1CH 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 28:21" />Uamowuüa hai Leviuüa kowh chowlowkkow thumchakuüa kowi paw Thurai chup kim lup nachang kownkow rik tekta pe khowk chekhai, now lowra sia kowi achang kiakma mih maru-uüa paw Thurai chup kim lup natawi khowng en kown. Nami klen kowi aluchowuüa hai maru kawmuüa paw en kowh ana pek nachün en kown taih,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 28:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="1CH 29" />
  <para style="s">Thurai chup kim chang müa uanh pek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1CH 29:1" />Nami kung kowi maru maten kowi mang David tek pe mih, “Nathawp Thurai chup kim kownkow ang chapa Sawlawmawn kowi Thurai ruiah khai. Thurai chup kim lup chang dow kri kraingma chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow nami kim dow CHAKRAMANG Thurai vüi chekhai; maru vüi nadowi. Nachenganchepaw Sawlawmawn kowh dow ning diachow taih tak, now tukra paw a-echow taih tak chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 29:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1CH 29:2" />Naiawng rakowi ang ia mowr dow ang kowh Thurai chup kim chang müa kowi kuh, tai, kri, lawngha hai singh ün ang kramla pe khowk. Naiawngün klen kowi asung khakma mih hua paw achap ahuma ang kamrütta pe hüah khowk. <verse eid="1CH 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1CH 29:3" />Naiawngün uanh ang kramla pe mih klen kowi paw ang kowh Thurai chup kim kowi ang matia kowh kuh hai tai paw ang pe sangrum khowk. <verse eid="1CH 29:3" /><verse number="4-5" style="v" sid="1CH 29:4-5" />Nami Thurai chup kimbang kowi natawngla kown mih vüi hai kim chang sarauüa nachangla akeng mih lup kown mih vüi Ofir süng hownia kowh kuh 2,830 mawn ngia hai tai achangma mih 6,640 mawn ngia ang peta khowk. Now enni pungmadawng hownia mia ngai chow tawi pe kown nau mih kawmat uowi ne bow?” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 29:4-5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1CH 29:6" />Nakhowk khe chowlowkkow krungchak kowi kowh aluchowuüa, chowlowkkow machak kowi kowh aluchowuüa, 100 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa, 1,000 ia siphai luk kowi kowh aluchowuüa hai mang kowh maru iukuüa mih awmrawmma hown tawi pe uanh khai. <verse eid="1CH 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1CH 29:7" />Nachangla Thurai chup kim kown mih vüi amatni dow kuh 4,760 mawn hai pawisa iawng thawpah mih 10,000 iun, tai 9,500 mawn, kri 17,100 mawn, lawngha 95,000 mawn tawi pe khai. <verse eid="1CH 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1CH 29:8" />Now asung khakma mih hua uowi miuüa dow CHAKRAMANG kim kowi kowh dawngthawnguan towk rah kowi natowah kownkow Levi chenchap Gersawn machak Jehiel rut kowi appe khai. <verse eid="1CH 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1CH 29:9" />Amatni dow awmrawmma hai saktuak iungma CHAKRAMANG kowi nowng pe rakowi lainowmma piaw khai. Now mang David paw lainowmma awmrawm khai.<verse eid="1CH 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">David rowsi Thurai mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1CH 29:10" />Naiawng rakowi maru kawmuüa pur kowi maiawng David rowsi Thurai khai,</para>
  <para style="b" vid="1CH 29:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:10">“Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging pipu Israeluüa kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:10">en dow chowngchowng saksakma rowsi hai akiow pauowi reng lah.<verse eid="1CH 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1CH 29:11" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, kraingra ün, kürra ün, klangiungra ün,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">awngra hai rowsira ün en kowh chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:11">Mukuang hai lusa kowi kowh uowi mih maten en kowh chowtaih,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:11">lowra luk kowi chowm mang mih hai alow uowi mih dow en chowtaih chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 29:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1CH 29:12" />Kurengra hai ringkawra uang ting mih dow en hownia chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:12">lowra chap kowi kruitown mih dow en chowtaih chekhai.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1CH 29:12">En rut kowi dow kür hai nowng changra uowi chekhai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:12">maru kowi iukra hai kürra napela kown mih alow uowi mih dow en tut-e chowtaih.<verse eid="1CH 29:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1CH 29:13" />Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging kowh Thurai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:13">anging awr tek en awmrawm lai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1CH 29:13">en kowh ming rowsira uowima mih rakowi anging kiow en.<verse eid="1CH 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1CH 29:14" />“Nachenganchepaw aw CHAKRAMANG, maiawng awmrawmma hown nape en uanh kown mih ang hai ang maru-uüa dow tawngpaw nadowi chekhai. Tawngplawng kowchow panow lowra sia dow en hownia kowh uang ting mih chowtaih; anging pe en mih dow en hownia kowh anging kaah mih kangowh chowtaih. <verse eid="1CH 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1CH 29:15" />Anging hai anging pipu-uüa dow lusa kowi prenlang maru iawng chowtaih mih en tuk chekhai. Lusa kowi anging uang uowi mih khin dow nawngchow now tama mih nim iawng chowtaih. Kowngra kowi dow miapaw ia ria dowi chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1CH 29:16" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG anging kowh Thurai, en kowh ming chimsaima mih vüi nachang kim lowk kownkow ahuma anging uang pawla uanh mih dow en hownia kowh anging kaah mih kangowh chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1CH 29:17" />Aw Thurai, en dow chaing maru sak reng, now anowm kowi en awmrawm reng pami ang tuk. Maiawngün uanh maten dow awmrawmma hai saktuak anowmma hown ang uang pe mih chekhai. Nami klen kowi kawmat kowh mami re-e uowi mih en maru-uüa paw awmrawmma hown pe en uanh khai.<verse eid="1CH 29:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1CH 29:18" />“Aw CHAKRAMANG, anging pipu Abraham, Isak hai Israel büah kowh Thurai, en maru-uüa kowh saktuak kowi maiawng mih saktuak chowngchowng saksakma tow pe reng diah, now amatni kowh saktuak mih en kaah sakowm iawng tow pe reng diah. <verse eid="1CH 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1CH 29:19" />Now en kowh laiklow hai en kowh ari aiang nanowng chünla kownkow hai nathawp en kim kownkow ang kamrütta khowk mih nanowng changla kownkow ang chapa Sawlawmawn kowi saktuak anikma chang pe diah,” pakhai.<verse eid="1CH 29:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1CH 29:20" />Nami kung kowi dow maru kawmuüa kowi David tek pe mih, “CHAKRAMANG enni kowh Thurai kowi rowsi kiowri büa diah,” pakhai. Nakhowk khe amatni dow CHAKRAMANG amatni pipu-uüa kowh Thurai kowi rowsiah khai, now CHAKRAMANG hai amatni kowh mang kowi tabawk krawm se chupah büah khai.<verse eid="1CH 29:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sawlawmawn chowng mang mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1CH 29:21" />Now auai ni dow CHAKRAMANG vüi tawncher uanap hai tikah mih uanap pawi chang büah khai. Amatni dow Israeluüa maten vüi chiala 1,000 pum, ruapur 1,000 pum hai ruapur chah 1,000 pum hown chang phuchua khai. Now naiawngün uanap klen kowi paw khowmta bowkta mih hüngah mih uanap hai tawncher ahuma hown akeng mih uanap pawi paw chang büah khai. <verse eid="1CH 29:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1CH 29:22" />Nami ni dow amatni mih CHAKRAMANG pur kowi apiaw apama hown cha büah kham büah khai.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1CH 29:22">Nakhowk khe amatni dow Sawlawmawn kowi mih mang chowbowt pahai plan phuangah khai iawk. Now aia kowi ap pe mangra kownkow hai Zadawk kowi ap pe uamow rah kownkow CHAKRAMANG pur kowi nümnapah khai. <verse eid="1CH 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1CH 29:23" />Nakhowk khe Sawlawmawn dow a-pa David takcha CHAKRAMANG ruiah mih mang iawng hai mang chowm rah kowi chowm khai bowt. Aia dow lowra lup kowi chawn reng chekhai, now Israeluüa maten mih aia laiklow iawng chang reng chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="1CH 29:24" />Now aluchowuüa maten, siphaiuüa maten hai mang David kowh akeng mih chapauüa maten dow Sawlawmawn nimkrüa kowi nauowi kownkow takham khai bowt. <verse eid="1CH 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1CH 29:25" />Now Sawlawmawn kowi dow Israeluüa maten mik kowi kri kraingma CHAKRAMANG changah khai, now aia kowi dow aia dowi rawn kowh manguüa kaah dowi mih rowsira ün CHAKRAMANG peah khai.<verse eid="1CH 29:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mang David kowng mih</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="1CH 29:26" />Israeluüa maten luk kowi Jese kowh chapa David chowmla mang mih dow 40 ning chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="1CH 29:27" />Aia chowmla mang mih dow Hebrawn marow kowi ranit ning, now Jerusalem marow kowi 33 ning chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="1CH 29:28" />Aia dow dawngthawnguan hai ringkawra ahuma kala khai, now lawngtangma khowk khe kowng khai. Aia takcha kowi dow achapa Sawlawmawn mih ta chowm mang khai. <verse eid="1CH 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="1CH 29:29" />David chowm mang mih lawnguan dow auown hownia achur pat Risi Samuel Kowh Chownglawng Lawnguan bowih kowi, Risi Nathan Kowh Chownglawng Lawnguan bowih kowi hai Risi Gat Kowh Chownglawng Lawnguan bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai. <verse eid="1CH 29:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="1CH 29:30" />Aia chowm mang khe kowh aia kowh nowng changra lawnguan, aiamat lawnguan, Israeluüa lawnguan hai akeng pren lawnguan maten paw naiawngün bowih kowi arui uowi bowk chekhai.<verse eid="1CH 29:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1CH 29" />
</usx>